rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Any \'X\' in the creature\'s cost is treated as zero."}, {\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': \'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You don\'t pay any costs of that creature card, including additional costs."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Can\'t target itself because you choose the target before you tap him. At that time he is not yet a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If the creature is no longer tapped when the Assassin\'s ability resolves, then the ability doesn\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card has a triggered ability that causes a separate effect for 1 point of damage each time a land is tapped for mana.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If any lands are tapped for mana while a player is casting a spell or activating an ability, Manabarbs’s ability will trigger that many times and wait. When the player finishes casting that spell or activating that ability, it’s put on the stack, then Manabarbs’s triggered abilities are put on the stack on top of it. The Manabarbs abilities will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'On the other hand, a player can tap lands for mana, let the Manabarbs triggered abilities be put on the stack, and then respond to those abilities by casting an instant or activating an ability using that mana. In that case, the spell or ability will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability will trigger each time a land is tapped for mana. Each ability is separate.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This ability is not a mana ability. It goes on the stack and can be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice more than one Goblin to get a greater effect.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Players can only respond once Goblin Grenade has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try and destroy the Goblin to prevent you from casting Goblin Grenade.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The Goblin you sacrifice to cast Goblin Grenade doesn’t have to be a creature. For example, you could sacrifice Boggart Shenanigans (a tribal enchantment with the subtype Goblin).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "If Sengir Vampire deals nonlethal damage to a creature and then a different effect or damage source causes that creature to be put into a graveyard later in the turn, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger and it will get a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Each time a creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, check whether Sengir Vampire had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger. It doesn\'t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If Sengir Vampire and a creature it dealt damage to are both put into a graveyard at the same time, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger, but it will do nothing when it resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'Regeneration abilities that would affect that creature can still be activated; they just won’t do anything. The creature can’t be regenerated for any reason, even if an effect other than Incinerate would deal lethal damage to it or otherwise destroy it.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the targeted nonland permanent forever.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If there are no nonland permanents on the battlefield other than an Oblivion Ring, and the card it exiled was another Oblivion Ring, casting a third Oblivion Ring will result in an involuntary infinite loop that will end the game in a draw (unless someone chooses to break it by putting another nonland permanent onto the battlefield or destroying one of the Oblivion Rings, for example).'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the exiled card is an Aura, that card’s owner chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything, but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled forever.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This card now uses the Reach keyword ability to enable the blocking of flying creatures. This works because a creature with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You choose the target when the ability triggers. When the ability resolves, you choose a value for X and decide whether to pay {X}{R}. If you do decide to pay {X}{R}, it’s too late for any player to respond since the ability is already in the midst of resolving.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Forest or Plains, not for lands named Forest or Plains. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Hallowed Fountain (a nonbasic land with the land types Plains and Island), Sunpetal Grove will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Island or Swamp, not for lands named Island or Swamp. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Blood Crypt (a nonbasic land with the land types Swamp and Mountain), Drowned Catacomb will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Mountain or Forest, not for lands named Mountain or Forest. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Temple Garden (a nonbasic land with the land types Forest and Plains), Rootbound Crag will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Plains or Island, not for lands named Plains or Island. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Watery Grave (a nonbasic land with the land types Island and Swamp), Glacial Fortress will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Swamp or Mountain, not for lands named Swamp or Mountain. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Stomping Ground (a nonbasic land with the land types Mountain and Forest), Dragonskull Summit will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s first ability affects only other Elves you control. However, Elvish Archdruid\'s second ability counts all Elves you control — including itself."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Activating the ability during your opponent’s turn after attackers have been declared will have no effect. The same is true if you activate the ability during your own turn.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'After the ability resolves, the targeted creature attacks you only if it’s able to do so as that turn’s declare attackers step begins. If, at that time, the creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” it can’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so the creature doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature would be able to attack either you or a planeswalker you control, it must attack you, not the planeswalker.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Cemetery Reaper grants +1/+1 to all other Zombie creatures you control, not just the ones its ability puts onto the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The creature card in a graveyard is exiled as part of the activated ability\'s effect, not as a cost. If that card has left the graveyard by the time the ability would resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve and you don\'t get a Zombie token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'For a player’s life total to become 10, what actually happens is that the player gains or loses the appropriate amount of life. For example, if the targeted opponent’s life total is 4 when this ability resolves, it will cause that player to gain 6 life; alternately, if the targeted player’s life total is 17 when this ability resolves, it will cause that player to lose 7 life. Other cards that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'If the player affected by Sorin’s third ability skips their next turn, the ability will wait. You’ll control the next turn the affected player actually takes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time Sorin’s first ability resolves, the entire ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Multiple player-controlling effects that affect the same player overwrite each other. The last one to be created is the one that works.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Sorin’s third ability allows you to control another player. This effect applies to the next turn that the affected player actually takes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'The player who is being controlled is still the active player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'While controlling another player, you also continue to make your own choices and decisions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "While controlling another player, you make all choices and decisions that player is allowed to make or is told to make during that turn. For example: -- You choose which lands the other player plays. -- You choose which spells the other player casts, and make all decisions as those spells are cast and as they resolve. For example, you choose the value of X for that player\'s Earthquake, the target for that player\'s Lightning Bolt, what mana that player spends to cast Day of Judgment, and what card that player gets with Diabolic Tutor. -- You choose which activated abilities the other player activates, and make all decisions as those abilities are activated and as they resolve. For example, you can have your opponent sacrifice their creatures to their Vampire Aristocrat or have your opponent\'s Caller of Gales give one of your creatures flying. -- You make all decisions for the other player\'s triggered abilities, including what they target and any decisions made when they resolve. -- You choose which creatures controlled by the other player attack, who or what they attack, and how they assign their combat damage. -- You make any choices and decisions that player would make for any other reason. For example, you could cast Fact or Fiction, choose that player to divide the revealed cards into piles, and thus divide those cards into piles yourself."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'You can use only the affected player’s resources (cards, mana, and so on) to pay costs for that player; you can’t use your own. Similarly, you can use the affected player’s resources only to pay that player’s costs; you can’t spend them on your costs.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'You can’t make any illegal decisions or illegal choices — you can’t do anything that player couldn’t do. You can’t make choices or decisions for that player that aren’t called for by the game rules or by any cards, permanents, spells, abilities, and so on. If an effect causes another player to make decisions that the affected player would normally make (such as Master Warcraft does), that effect takes precedence. (In other words, if the affected player wouldn’t make a decision, you wouldn’t make that decision on their behalf.) You also can’t make any choices or decisions for the player that would be called for by the tournament rules (such as whether to take an intentional draw or whether to call a judge).\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'You can’t make the affected player concede. That player may choose to concede at any time, even while you’re controlling their turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'You could gain control of yourself using Sorin’s third ability, but unless you do so to overwrite someone else’s player-controlling effect, this doesn’t do anything.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'You only control the player. You don’t control any of the other player’s permanents, spells, or abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Sorin’s second ability causes the targeted opponent’s team’s life total to become 10. Only the targeted player is actually considered to have actually gained or lost life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'Controlling a player doesn’t allow you to look at that player’s sideboard. If an effect instructs that player to choose a card from outside the game, you can’t have that player choose any card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'While controlling another player, you can see all cards in the game that player can see. This includes cards in that player’s hand, face-down cards that player controls, and any cards in that player’s library the player may look at.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a creature doesn’t have first strike, granting it first strike after combat damage has been dealt in the first combat damage step won’t prevent it from dealing combat damage. It will still assign and deal its combat damage in the second combat damage step.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a black spell, Demon’s Horn’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Demon’s Horn’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a black spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a blue spell, Kraken’s Eye’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Kraken’s Eye’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a blue spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a green spell, Wurm’s Tooth’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Wurm’s Tooth’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a green spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a red spell, Dragon’s Claw’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Dragon’s Claw’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a red spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a white spell, Angel’s Feather’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Angel’s Feather’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a white spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, Ice Cage’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell or ability. Ice Cage’s ability will resolve (causing Ice Cage to be destroyed) first.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time Consume Spirit would resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is equal to the number chosen for X, not the amount of damage Consume Spirit deals (in case some of it is prevented).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Lands are colorless (even if their frames have some colored elements to them). You can’t target a Swamp, a Mountain, or any other land with Celestial Purge (unless some other effect has turned that land black or red).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Overrun affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability affects whichever creature is enchanted by Firebreathing at the time the ability resolves. The bonus remains even if Firebreathing stops enchanting that creature.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This ability can be activated by Firebreathing’s controller, not the enchanted creature’s controller (in case they’re different players).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The controller of the enchanted creature, not the controller of Lifelink, gains the life (in case they’re different players).'}]", "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'Brink of Disaster may target and may enchant a permanent that’s already tapped. It won’t do anything until the enchanted permanent changes from being untapped to being tapped.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted permanent is tapped as a cost to activate a mana ability, the mana ability resolves immediately, then Brink of Disaster’s ability goes on the stack.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted permanent is tapped as a cost to activate an ability that’s not a mana ability, Brink of Disaster’s ability will go on the stack on top of that activated ability. Brink of Disaster’s ability resolves first (destroying that permanent), then the permanent’s activated ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'When the enchanted permanent becomes tapped, Brink of Disaster’s ability triggers. That permanent will be destroyed when the ability resolves, even if Brink of Disaster has left the battlefield or is somehow enchanting a different permanent by then.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability applies during each combat phase of the affected player’s next turn (as opposed to applying during the affected player’s next combat phase). The distinction is relevant if there are no combat phases during that turn (due to Fatespinner’s effect, for example) or there are multiples (due to World at War, for example).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability causes creatures to attack him if able. If, during the affected player’s declare attackers step, a creature they control is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” then that creature doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so the creature doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability doesn’t lock in what it applies to. That’s because the effect states a true thing about a set of creatures, but doesn’t actually change the characteristics of those creatures. As a result, whatever creatures the targeted opponent controls during the declare attackers step of their next turn must attack Gideon Jura if able. This includes creatures that come under that player’s control after the ability has resolved and creatures that have lost all abilities.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s third ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: Gideon is just a planeswalker type (not a creature type), and Human and Soldier are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Gideon Jura becomes a creature due to his third ability, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Gideon Jura was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Gideon Jura becomes a creature, he may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any) unless he began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when Gideon Jura came under your control, not when he became a creature.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature controlled by the affected player can’t attack Gideon Jura (because he’s no longer on the battlefield, for example), that player may have it attack you, another one of your planeswalkers, or nothing at all.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you activate Gideon Jura’s third ability and then unpreventable damage is dealt to him (due to Unstable Footing, for example), that damage has all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon Jura (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). If the total amount of damage marked on Gideon Jura is lethal damage, he’s destroyed as a state-based action. If Gideon Jura has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Say you activate Gideon Jura’s third ability, then an opponent gains control of him before combat. You may have any of your creatures attack Gideon Jura (since he’s still a planeswalker). Then Gideon Jura may block (since he’s a creature). He may block any eligible attacking creature, including one that’s attacking him! During combat, he behaves as an attacked planeswalker and/or a blocking creature, as appropriate. For example, he deals combat damage to any creatures he’s blocking, but he doesn’t deal combat damage to any unblocked creatures that are attacking him.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The first ability only affects the declaration of attackers. If a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking (thanks to Hero of Bladehold, Preeminent Captain, or the Ninjutsu ability, for example), that creature’s controller may choose the defending player or planeswalker that it will be attacking in the normal way.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The ability doesn’t grant an ability to the targeted creature. Rather, it affects the game rules and states something that’s now true about that creature. After the ability resolves, the creature can’t be blocked that turn even if it loses all abilities.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The power of the targeted creature is checked both as you target it and as the ability resolves. After the ability resolves, the creature can’t be blocked that turn even if its power becomes greater than 2.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as you put Inferno Titan\'s triggered ability on the stack, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. (In other words, as you put the ability on the stack, you choose whether to have it deal 3 damage to a single target, 2 damage to one target and 1 damage to another target, or 1 damage to each of three targets.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Activating Cudgel Troll’s ability causes a “regeneration shield” to be created for it. The next time Cudgel Troll would be destroyed that turn, the regeneration shield is used up instead. This works only if Cudgel Troll is dealt lethal damage, dealt damage from a source with deathtouch, or affected by a spell or ability that says to “destroy” it. Other effects that cause Cudgel Troll to be put into the graveyard (such as reducing its toughness to 0 or sacrificing it) don’t destroy it, so regeneration won’t save it. If it hasn’t been used, the regeneration shield goes away as the turn ends.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If Cudgel Troll is dealt lethal damage and is dealt damage by a source with deathtouch during the same combat damage step, a single regeneration shield will save it.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'To work, the regeneration shield must be created before Cudgel Troll is destroyed. This usually means activating its ability during the declare blockers step, or in response to a spell or ability that would destroy it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'After Autumn’s Veil resolves, any spell you control that turn can still be targeted by spells that try to counter it (such as Cancel), regardless of their color. If those spells are blue or black at the time they would resolve, they will resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter the spell you control simply won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'After Autumn’s Veil resolves, no new blue or black spell may be cast that turn targeting a creature you control.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Autumn’s Veil affects any spells and creatures you happen to control at any point during the rest of the turn, not just spells and creatures you control as it resolves. That’s because it doesn’t grant an ability to those spells or creatures; rather, it affects the game rules and states something that’s now true about those spells and creatures.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Autumn’s Veil has no effect on abilities. After it resolves, spells you control may be countered by abilities from blue or black sources, and creatures you control may be targeted by abilities from blue or black sources.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Autumn’s Veil itself may be countered by blue or black spells. Its effect doesn’t apply until after it resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If a creature you control is being targeted by a spell when Autumn’s Veil resolves, nothing happens right away. When that spell would resolve, its color is checked. If it’s blue or black, that creature will be an illegal target for that spell, and will be unable to be affected by it. If all that spell’s targets have become illegal by the time it would resolve, it won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Keep in mind that an Aura spell targets the permanent it will enchant (but an Aura on the battlefield doesn’t target the permanent it’s attached to).'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Combust can be targeted by spells and abilities that try to counter it (such as Cancel). Those spells and abilities will resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Combust won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells and abilities have will work as normal.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Effects that replace or redirect damage without using the word “prevent” aren’t affected by Combust; they’ll work as normal.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If a creature is dealt lethal damage by Combust, it can still regenerate. If it does, the damage marked on it will be removed from it.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If a static ability would prevent damage from being dealt to the targeted creature, it fails to prevent the damage dealt by Combust. If that ability has an additional effect that doesn’t depend on the amount of damage prevented, that additional effect will still work. It’s applied just once as Combust resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Combust would resolve, Combust won’t resolve for having an illegal target.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Spells that create prevention effects affecting the targeted creature can still be cast, and abilities that create prevention effects affecting the targeted creature can still be activated. However, damage prevention shields (including those created before Combust was cast) don’t have any effect on the damage dealt by Combust. If such a prevention effect has an additional effect, the additional effect will still work (if possible).'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Frost Titan’s first ability affects each spell (including Aura spells), activated ability, and triggered ability that’s controlled by an opponent and that Frost Titan becomes a target of.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the permanent affected by Frost Titan’s second ability changes controllers before its old controller’s next untap step, Frost Titan’s second ability will prevent it from being untapped during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the permanent affected by Frost Titan’s second ability is untapped at the time that permanent’s controller’s next untap step begins, the last part of Frost Titan’s second ability has no effect.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'You may target any permanent with Frost Titan’s second ability. It’s okay if that permanent is already tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Harbor Serpent’s abilities care about lands with the land type Island, not necessarily lands named Island.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'The second ability checks how many Islands are on the battlefield (regardless of who controls them) only as attackers are declared. Once Harbor Serpent is declared as an attacker, it will continue to attack even if the number of Islands on the battlefield falls below five.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to draw multiple cards, Jace’s Erasure’s ability triggers that many times. (The spell or ability finishes resolving before you put Jace’s Erasure’s abilities on the stack.)'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards in your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” Jace’s Erasure’s ability won’t trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the copy says that it affects "you," it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an "opponent," it affects an opponent of the copy\\\'s controller, not an opponent of the original spell\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the spell Reverberate copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the spell Reverberate copies is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "Reverberate can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn\'t matter who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'When Reverberate resolves, it creates a copy of a spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if a player sacrifices a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it with Reverberate, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target."}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the targeted spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), you can’t choose a different mode.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you cast Redirect targeting a spell that targets a spell on the stack (like Cancel does, for example), you can’t change that spell’s target to itself. You can, however, change that spell’s target to Redirect. If you do, that spell won’t resolve when it tries to resolve because Redirect will have left the stack by then.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Redirect can target any spell, not just an instant or sorcery spell. For example, you could use it to change the target of an Aura spell. However, if the targeted spell has no targets (for example, if it’s an instant or sorcery spell that doesn’t specifically use the word “target,” or if it’s a creature spell), Redirect won’t have any effect on it.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when Aether Adept enters the battlefield, it must target itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you sacrifice an attacking or blocking Brindle Boar during the declare blockers step, it won’t deal combat damage. If you wait until the combat damage step, but Brindle Boar is dealt lethal damage, it’ll be destroyed before you get a chance to sacrifice it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Manic Vandal’s ability is mandatory. If you’re the only player who controls an artifact, you must target one of them.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Paying the activation cost of Elixir of Immortality’s ability doesn’t cause it to leave the battlefield. If you have a way to untap it, you can activate the ability multiple times in response to itself.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'As the ability resolves, you’ll shuffle Elixir of Immortality into its owner’s library directly from the battlefield, if it’s still there.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Elixir of Immortality is in your graveyard at the time the ability resolves, you’ll still wind up shuffling it into your library because you shuffle your entire graveyard into your library. If it’s anywhere else by that time, including in another player’s graveyard, it remains where it is and you shuffle just your graveyard into your library.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s Elixir of Immortality and activate it, the Elixir of Immortality will be shuffled into its owner’s library and the cards in your graveyard will be shuffled into your library. You are considered to have shuffled each affected library (even if, as a shortcut, each player physically shuffles their own library).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Ending the turn this way means the following things happen in order: 1) All spells and abilities on the stack are exiled. This includes spells and abilities that can\'t be countered. 2) All attacking and blocking creatures are removed from combat. 3) State-based actions are checked. No player gets priority, and no triggered abilities are put onto the stack. 4) The current phase and/or step ends. The game skips straight to the cleanup step. The cleanup step happens in its entirety."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If Sundial of the Infinite’s ability is activated before the end step, any “at the beginning of the end step”-triggered abilities won’t get the chance to trigger that turn because the end step is skipped. Those abilities will trigger at the beginning of the end step of the next turn. The same is true of abilities that trigger at the beginning of other phases or steps (except upkeep).\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If any triggered abilities do trigger during this process, they’re put onto the stack during the cleanup step. If this happens, players will have a chance to cast spells and activate abilities, then there will be another cleanup step before the turn finally ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The earliest that you can activate Sundial of the Infinite’s ability is during your upkeep step, after abilities that trigger “at the beginning of your upkeep” have been put onto the stack but before they resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'Though spells and abilities that are exiled won’t get a chance to resolve, they don’t count as being “countered.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If Angelic Destiny is no longer in a graveyard when its triggered ability resolves, it won\'t be returned to its owner\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the creature dies before the Angelic Destiny spell resolves, Angelic Destiny will go to its owner\'s graveyard. It won\'t return to its owner\'s hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The creature that entered the battlefield deals damage equal to its current power to the targeted permanent or player. If it\'s no longer on the battlefield, its last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Warstorm Surge is the source of the ability, but the creature is the source of the damage. The ability couldn\'t target a creature with protection from red, for example. It could target a creature with protection from creatures, but all the damage would be prevented. Since damage is dealt by the creature, abilities like lifelink, deathtouch and infect are taken into account, even if the creature has left the battlefield by the time it deals damage."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'A creature spell like Phantasmal Image that may enter the battlefield as a copy of a creature is not a Vampire creature spell, even if you intend on copying a Vampire creature when that creature enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Multiple instances of bloodthirst are cumulative. For example, if you control Bloodlord of Vaasgoth and cast a Vampire creature spell that already has bloodthirst 1, that Vampire will enter the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it if an opponent has been dealt damage that turn.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Vampire creatures you put directly onto the battlefield without casting them and Vampire creature tokens you put onto the battlefield will not gain bloodthirst 3 from Bloodlord of Vaasgoth.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'A multicolored creature with intimidate can be blocked by any creature that shares a color with it, in addition to artifact creatures. For example, a white-blue creature with intimidate can be blocked by white creatures and/or blue creatures, no matter what other colors they are.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If an attacking creature has intimidate, what colors it is matters only as the defending player declares blockers. Once it’s blocked, changing its colors won’t change that.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Activating the ability granted to the enchanted creature causes a “regeneration shield” to be created for it. The next time that creature would be destroyed that turn, the regeneration shield is used up instead. This works only if the creature is dealt lethal damage, dealt damage from a source with deathtouch, or affected by a spell or ability that says to “destroy” it. Other effects that cause the creature to be put into the graveyard (such as reducing its toughness to 0 or sacrificing it) don’t destroy it, so regeneration won’t save it. If it hasn’t been used, the regeneration shield goes away as the turn ends.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is dealt lethal damage and is dealt damage by a source with deathtouch during the same combat damage step, a single regeneration shield will save it.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'To work, the regeneration shield must be created before the enchanted creature is destroyed. This usually means activating its ability during the declare blockers step, or in response to a spell or ability that would destroy it.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Trollhide needs to be attached to the creature as the ability that creates the regeneration shield is activated, but after that, the regeneration shield will be created and remain in effect even if Trollhide is no longer attached to the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'All of the control-change effects happen at the same time.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Each nonland permanent will untap, no matter which player was randomly chosen to gain control of it.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'For each nonland permanent, any player may be randomly chosen, including the permanent’s current controller.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Once Scrambleverse starts to resolve, no player may respond until it has finished resolving. For example, you can’t wait to see who will control a creature before deciding whether or not to activate one of its abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Chandra’s second ability creates a delayed triggered ability that will copy the next instant or sorcery spell you cast that turn, regardless of whether that spell has targets.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the spell Chandra copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Consume Spirit does), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the spell Chandra copies is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'When the delayed trigger resolves, it creates a copy of a spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'When you activate Chandra’s last ability, you choose up to six target creatures and/or players. No damage is divided, and Chandra can’t deal more than 6 damage to any one target. Chandra deals 6 damage to each target that is still legal when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if you sacrifice a 3/3 creature to cast Fling after activating Chandra’s second ability, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Consider only the number of +1/+1 counters on Primordial Hydra when determining if it has trample, not its power and toughness. For example, a Primordial Hydra with six +1/+1 counters on it that’s been the target of Titanic Growth (giving it +4/+4) would not have trample.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Dungrove Elder’s ability sets its power and toughness in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Dungrove Elder’s power and toughness are each equal to the number of lands you control with the land type Forest, not necessarily lands named Forest.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Dungrove Elder’s power and toughness will change as the number of Forests you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'For Garruk’s second ability, the greatest power among creatures you control is determined when that ability begins resolving.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'For Garruk’s third ability, the number of Wurm tokens you put onto the battlefield is determined when that ability begins resolving.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the greatest power among creatures you control is 0 or less, you’ll draw no cards. You won’t discard any cards this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Grand Abolisher doesn’t affect triggered abilities or static abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Grand Abolisher doesn’t stop your opponents from activating abilities of artifact, creature, or enchantment cards in zones other than the battlefield (like cycling abilities, for example).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Guardians’ Pledge only gives a bonus to white creatures you control when it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn and nonwhite creatures that become white later in the turn will not get the bonus.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If a white creature that gets the bonus stops being white later in the turn, it will continue to get +2/+2 until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Aegis Angel and the permanent would be destroyed simultaneously, only Aegis Angel will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Aegis Angel leaves the battlefield, you no longer control it.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Aegis Angel, the permanent will no longer have indestructible, even if you regain control of Aegis Angel.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Jace’s third ability causes a player to draw more cards than are left in their library, that player loses the game as a state-based action. If this ability causes all players to do this, the game is a draw.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you activate Jace’s first ability, and the player is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you target yourself with Jace’s first ability, you’ll draw a card first, then put the top card of your library into your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Master Thief ceases to be under your control before its ability resolves, you won’t gain control of the targeted artifact at all.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Master Thief leaves the battlefield, you no longer control it, and its control-change effect ends.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Master Thief, its control-change effect ends. Regaining control of Master Thief won’t cause you to regain control of the artifact.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Pride Guardian gains the ability to block additional creatures and does so, you’ll still gain only 3 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Vengeful Pharaoh is no longer in your graveyard when the triggered ability would resolve, the triggered ability won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If multiple creatures deal combat damage to you and to a planeswalker you control simultaneously, Vengeful Pharaoh will trigger twice. The first trigger will cause Vengeful Pharaoh to be put on top of your library. The second trigger will then do nothing, as Vengeful Pharaoh is no longer in your graveyard when it tries to resolve. Note that the second trigger will do nothing even if Vengeful Pharaoh is put back into your graveyard before it tries to resolve, as it’s a different Vengeful Pharaoh than the one that was there before.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If multiple creatures deal combat damage to you simultaneously, Vengeful Pharaoh will only trigger once.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the attacking creature is an illegal target when the triggered ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Vengeful Pharaoh will remain in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If your own attacking creatures deal combat damage to you or a planeswalker you control (perhaps because combat damage was redirected), Vengeful Pharaoh will still trigger. You must target and destroy one of your own attacking creatures.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Vengeful Pharaoh must be in your graveyard when combat damage is dealt to you or a planeswalker you control in order for its ability to trigger. That is, it can’t die and trigger from your graveyard during the same combat damage step.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If a player controls no creatures, or each creature they control is a Zombie, that player does nothing when the first ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If there is at least one creature on the battlefield at the beginning of the end step, the last ability won’t trigger. If it does trigger, but a creature enters the battlefield before it resolves, the ability won’t do anything when it resolves. Call to the Grave’s controller won’t sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Call to the Grave will trigger twice during each team’s upkeep, once for each player. Each of the two players will sacrifice a non-Zombie creature when the ability referring to that player resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If an opponent’s creature enters the battlefield tapped, Gideon’s Avenger’s ability doesn’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If another player controls Arbalest Elite during your next untap step, the part of the effect that keeps it from untapping does nothing. It won’t try to apply during a future untap step.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when Arbalest Elite’s ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Arbalest Elite will untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If another player controls Crumbling Colossus when its ability tries to resolve, you’ll be unable to sacrifice it. It will simply remain on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If any of the creature cards you exile has a characteristic-defining ability that defines its power and/or toughness, that ability will apply. For example, if Dungrove Elder is exiled this way, its power and toughness while it’s in exile are equal to the number of Forests you control, and Sutured Ghoul’s power and toughness will change as the number of Forests you control changes. If the characteristic-defining ability can’t be applied (for instance, it relies on a choice made as the card enters the battlefield), then use 0.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'In zones other than the battlefield, Sutured Ghoul’s power and toughness are each 0.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can’t have Sutured Ghoul exile itself, even if it’s entering the battlefield from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If any of the named cards stops being an artifact, it won’t be considered by these abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control artifacts named Scepter of Empires and Throne of Empires, the targeted creature won’t be tapped. You’ll just gain control of it.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Whether or not you control the correct artifacts is determined when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If any of the named cards stops being an artifact, it won’t be considered by these abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Whether or not you control the correct artifacts is determined when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the card is not a land card, it will remain on top of your library.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the revealed card is both a creature and a land (such as Dryad Arbor), you’ll put a Saproling creature token and that card onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the creature targeted by Dark Favor is an illegal target when Dark Favor tries to resolve, Dark Favor won’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield and its enters-the-battlefield ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the permanent or player is an illegal target when Goblin Bangchuckers’ ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t flip a coin and no damage will be dealt.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You choose the target when you activate the ability. You don’t flip the coin until the ability resolves. Players may respond to the ability, but they won’t know the results of the coin flip.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the player is an illegal target when Sorin’s Vengeance tries to resolve, Sorin’s Vengeance won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain life.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the player is an illegal target when Taste of Blood tries to resolve, Taste of Blood won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain life.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the top card of your library is Dryad Arbor (the only card that’s both a creature and a land), you can’t play it this way. Dryad Arbor can’t be cast as a spell.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Normally, Garruk’s Horde allows you to cast the top card of your library if it’s a creature card, it’s your main phase, and the stack is empty. If that creature card has flash, you’ll be able to cast it at the time you could cast an instant, even on an opponent’s turn.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, the new top card won’t be revealed until you finish doing so.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If there are one or zero cards in the player’s hand, they will discard no cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If this ability causes a player to draw more cards than are left in their library, that player loses the game as a state-based action. If this ability causes all players to do this, the game is a draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control a creature whose name has been changed by an effect (for example, a Clone that’s copying another creature), you’ll search for a card with the new name, not one with the original name.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control no creatures when Doubling Chant resolves, you may still search your library and you must shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The cards you find in your library must be creature cards. For example, you can’t put a land card onto the battlefield even if it has the same name as a land you control that’s also a creature (perhaps because of an ability of that land).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, you’ll compare your team’s life total with the opposing team’s life total. You’ll then compare the number of creatures you control (ignoring creatures your teammate controls) to the number of creatures each opponent controls separately.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, you consider each opponent. If you have less life than one of your opponents and fewer creatures than one of your opponents (although this may be a different opponent), you’ll get both bonuses.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You compare life totals with each of your opponents when Timely Reinforcements resolves. At that time, if you have less life than an opponent, you’ll gain 6 life. Similarly, you compare the number of creatures you control with the number of creatures each opponent controls when Timely Reinforcements resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Life loss is not the same as damage. Blood Seeker’s ability will not cause creatures with bloodthirst to enter the battlefield with +1/+1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Multiple instances of deathtouch on the same creature provide no additional benefit. A creature dealt damage by a creature with multiple instances of deathtouch is destroyed only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'No matter which mode you choose, Skinshifter will cease to have any creature types it previously had. If you activate its ability choosing the first mode, it will become only a Rhino; it’s no longer a Human or a Shaman.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'No matter which mode you choose, Skinshifter will retain any other card types it may have. For example, if an effect causes Skinshifter to be an artifact in addition to its other types and you activate its ability choosing the first mode, it will be both an artifact and a Rhino creature.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Skinshifter’s ability doesn’t affect its copiable values. Creatures that enter the battlefield as a copy of Skinshifter will enter as 1/1 Human Shaman creatures.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Skinshifter’s ability doesn’t cause it to lose any other abilities it may have.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can activate Skinshifter’s ability during any player’s turn, but only once on each turn.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You choose the ability’s mode when you activate it.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The ability is mandatory. You can’t choose to draw fewer cards than the number of lore counters on Mind Unbound.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The equipped creature is also destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can remove any +1/+1 counter on Pentavus to activate its first activated ability, not just ones created by Pentavus’s other abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Pentavite creature you control (such as an Adaptive Automaton with Pentavite as its chosen type) to activate Pentavus’s second activated ability, not just ones created by Pentavus’s other abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You choose the target as part of casting the spell. You choose what color the target gains protection from when the spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You choose the target creature with flying when the ability goes on the stack. When it resolves, you choose whether or not to destroy the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you target yourself with this spell, you must reveal your entire hand to the other players just as any other player would.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Circle of Flame’s ability triggers only if a creature without flying is declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step. If a creature with flying attacks you or a planeswalker you control and then loses flying, or if a creature without flying is put onto the battlefield attacking you or a planeswalker you control, the ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-02-01', 'text': 'Circle of Flame is banned in Pauper (not just non-legal), due to a special case on MTGO: https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/january-21-2019-banned-and-restricted-announcement'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one of the Theros block Gods is affected by Turn to Frog, it will be a legendary 1/1 blue Frog enchantment creature with no abilities. If it stops being a creature, perhaps because your devotion to its color(s) decreased, it will be a legendary blue enchantment with no abilities. The way continuous effects work, the God’s type-changing ability is applied before the effect that removes that ability is applied.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Turn to Frog resolves, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The creature will lose all other colors and creature types, but it will retain any other card types (such as artifact) or supertypes (such as legendary) it may have.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Turn to Frog doesn’t counter abilities that have already triggered or been activated. In particular, there is no way to cast this spell to stop a creature’s ability that says “At the beginning of your upkeep,” “When this creature enters the battlefield,” or similar from triggering.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Turn to Frog overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Turn to Frog resolves will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the creature targeted by Divine Favor is an illegal target when Divine Favor tries to resolve, Divine Favor won’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield and its enters-the-battlefield ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Arachnus Web’s triggered ability checks at the beginning of each end step, not just yours.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If Arachnus Web enters the battlefield attached to an attacking or blocking creature (due to Arachnus Spinner’s ability, for example), that creature will continue to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If Arachnus Web’s last ability triggers, but the enchanted creature’s power is reduced to 3 or less before the ability resolves, the ability will have no effect. Arachnus Web won’t be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature’s power isn’t 4 or greater when the end step begins, the last ability won’t trigger at all.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Phantasmal Image enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If Phantasmal Image somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Phantasmal Image can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is a token, Phantasmal Image copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Phantasmal Image is not a token in this case.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Phantasmal Image), then Phantasmal Image enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Phantasmal Image copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below) and it gains the Illusion creature type and the triggered ability. It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'The Illusion creature type and the triggered ability that Phantasmal Image gains as part of its copy effect are both copiable values that other effects may copy.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If you choose to search your library this way, you don’t have to find a card named Arachnus Web, even if one is there. You’ll still shuffle your library after searching it.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped Spider you control, including one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Arachnus Spinner’s activated ability. You can even tap Arachnus Spinner itself to pay this cost.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'You may search both your graveyard and your library, but you can find a maximum of one card named Arachnus Web.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "A pile can have no cards in it. In this case, you\'ll choose whether to put all the revealed cards into your hand or into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "In multiplayer games, you choose an opponent to separate the cards when the ability resolves. This doesn\'t target that opponent. Because the cards are revealed, all players may see the cards and offer opinions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You (not your opponent) choose which pile to put into your hand and which to put into your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Fireball\'s damage is divided as Fireball resolves, not as it\'s cast, because there are no choices involved. The division involves only targets that are still legal as Fireball resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'For example, if X is 5 and you choose three target creatures, Fireball has a total cost of {7}{R} (even though its mana cost is just {5}{R} and its mana value is 6). If those creatures are all still legal targets as Fireball resolves, it deals 1 damage to each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You can target more than X creatures. However, if the number of legal targets at the time Fireball resolves is greater than X, none of them will be dealt any damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You may cast Fireball with zero targets, regardless of the value chosen for X. If you do so, it will not be a targeted spell, and no damage will actually be dealt when it resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'As blockers are declared, any creature that’s tapped or affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, no player is forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t block if that cost isn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Lure doesn’t give any creatures the ability to block the target creature. It just forces those creatures that are already able to block the creature to do so.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You may find any land cards, not just basic land cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting or cycling the card you drew."}]', "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'If Phantasmal Bear becomes the target of a spell or ability, its ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of that spell or ability. The ability will resolve first (causing Phantasmal Bear to be sacrificed). Unless the spell or ability has another target, it will then be countered when it tries to resolve for having no legal targets. '}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Giving a creature flying after it’s already been blocked won’t change or undo that block. If you want to affect what can block the creature, you must cast Mighty Leap during the declare attackers step at the latest.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the revealed card is a land, you can play it only if it’s your turn and you haven’t yet played a land this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to play the exiled card, you must play it while the last ability of Djinn of Wishes is resolving. You can’t play it later in the turn. A spell cast this way may be cast at a time you normally wouldn’t be able to cast a spell of that type, but other restrictions (such as “Cast this spell only during combat”) are enforced.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You determine whether you’ll draw one or three cards as Visions of Beyond begins to resolve. This means that if you have nineteen cards in your graveyard and use a dredge ability to replace the one card draw, you won’t draw two more cards after that even though your graveyard now has twenty cards in it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Act of Treason can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Chandra\'s Outrage tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No player is dealt damage."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Because it doesn’t modify the characteristics of creatures, Tectonic Rift can affect creatures that enter the battlefield or lose flying after the spell resolves, and it will stop affecting creatures that gain flying.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target land is an illegal target by the time Tectonic Rift tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. Creatures without flying will be able to block as normal. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), creatures without flying will be unable to block.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Sorin’s Thirst tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 2 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to interfere with the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrificed creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Frost Breath can target tapped creatures. If a targeted creature is already tapped when the spell resolves, that creature just remains tapped and doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Even though Adaptive Automaton is a Construct, other Construct creatures you control won\'t get +1/+1 unless you chose Construct as Adaptive Automaton entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The choice of creature type is made as Adaptive Automaton enters the battlefield. Players can\'t take any actions between the time the choice is made and the time the appropriate creatures begin to get +1/+1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact and supertypes such as legendary can\'t be chosen."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any abilities of the lands sacrificed may modify or trigger on the creatures being sacrificed and on the cards being discarded. Abilities of the creatures won’t modify or trigger on the lands being sacrificed, but may modify or trigger on the cards being discarded.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger while Smallpox is resolving will wait to be put onto the stack until Smallpox is done resolving.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'As Smallpox resolves, first each player loses 1 life at the same time. Next, each player chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then all of the cards are discarded at the same time. Then starting with the player whose turn it is and proceeding in turn order, each player chooses a creature, knowing the choices made before them. All of the creatures are sacrificed at the same time, then finally repeat this process for lands.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If more than one Stonehorn Dignitary enters the battlefield and their abilities target the same opponent, that opponent will skip that many combat phases (over multiple turns if necessary). Skipping one combat phase won’t satisfy all of the effects.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once a combat phase starts, it can’t be skipped. A Stonehorn Dignitary entering the battlefield during combat won’t affect that combat, even if it’s the turn of the opponent chosen as the target of the triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you choose to shuffle your library, that includes the three cards you just looked at and put back on top of it.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Enchantments put onto the battlefield without being cast won’t cause Mesa Enchantress’s ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If the enchantment spell is countered, Mesa Enchantress’s ability still resolves and causes you to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Mesa Enchantress’s ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The two cards are exiled as the cost of Grim Lavamancer’s ability is paid. Players can’t respond to the paying of costs by trying to move those cards to another zone.'}]"]
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'Abbrechen', 'text': 'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263671&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e850f2e-e3b4-46dd-b59c-9150984f4d35', 'multiverseId': 263671}, 'multiverseid': 263671}, {'name': 'Deshacer', 'text': 'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264916&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e07e8eb7-a5bd-4c24-9c0c-b21c4b5ec91a', 'multiverseId': 264916}, 'multiverseid': 264916}, {'name': 'Révocation', 'text': 'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263422&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48806690-15f2-43fb-afd6-932982460dfd', 'multiverseId': 263422}, 'multiverseid': 263422}, {'name': 'Eliminare', 'text': 'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263920&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3748063c-f439-473b-b2ba-678320e3d144', 'multiverseId': 263920}, 'multiverseid': 263920}, {'name': '取り消し', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264169&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac27c938-9fe0-4a21-b95b-550bf17c8266', 'multiverseId': 264169}, 'multiverseid': 264169}, {'name': '무효화', 'text': '주문 한 개를 목표로 정해서 무효화한다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '698fa1d9-6a48-4abf-8a99-13d9e96c7e70'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cancelar', 'text': 'Anule a mágica alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264418&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5694e9f-fefc-4977-b358-69da56d82df4', 'multiverseId': 264418}, 'multiverseid': 264418}, {'name': 'Отмена', 'text': 'Отмените целевое заклинание.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264667&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15b4fe4f-233f-49e8-81f9-274f44597735', 'multiverseId': 264667}, 'multiverseid': 264667}, {'name': '取消', 'text': '反击目标咒语。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262924&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5c1319c-cb8e-4ab0-85a6-61d290ba6573', 'multiverseId': 262924}, 'multiverseid': 262924}, {'name': '取消', 'text': '反擊目標咒語。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263173&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91089f3a-1ce1-4560-ba36-716db1a166d1', 'multiverseId': 263173}, 'multiverseid': 263173}]", '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur der Wind soll die Luft beherrschen." —Dejara, Druide aus dem Güldenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263811&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5f16939-f4c6-43f7-a491-7220bff25a86\', \'multiverseId\': 263811}, \'multiverseid\': 263811}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo que tenga la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que no haya nada en los cielos, salvo el viento." —Dejara, druida de Madera Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6455bc-95da-4fdc-86eb-c1b9fbbe4983\', \'multiverseId\': 265056}, \'multiverseid\': 265056}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Seul le vent doit contrôler les cieux. » —Dejara, druide de Boisdoré\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263562&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1245a4-376e-483b-8144-4978613fd325\', \'multiverseId\': 263562}, \'multiverseid\': 263562}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare che nulla possieda i cieli se non il vento." —Dejara, druida di Boscodorato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd80369d-1f52-4ff7-b1ca-f8adf0eaf670\', \'multiverseId\': 264060}, \'multiverseid\': 264060}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「空にあるべきは風のみとしよう。」 ――黄金森のドルイド、デジャーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f233663-178a-49b4-9645-390a81defd13\', \'multiverseId\': 264309}, \'multiverseid\': 264309}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행 능력을 가진 생물 한 개를 목표로 정해서 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"하늘에는 오직 바람만 있게 하소서."—금빛숲 드루이드 데자라\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06141a3e-5f80-4a17-87c0-4f22ccfb5906\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Que nada além do vento domine os céus." — Dejara, druida de Tronco Dourado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c6d9054-76a5-4d40-a655-13f34a5d7f90\', \'multiverseId\': 264558}, \'multiverseid\': 264558}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть ничто не владеет небесами, кроме ветра». — Дежара, друид Золоченого Леса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6380fa4-c93b-476f-8e0e-795922c950ba\', \'multiverseId\': 264807}, \'multiverseid\': 264807}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「风该是天空唯一的主人。」 ～金林德鲁伊笛贾拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'930b2607-2e69-4fbd-80d6-071a767c8ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 263064}, \'multiverseid\': 263064}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「風該是天空唯一的主人。」 ～金林德魯伊笛賈拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d128498c-8ce0-4ec5-8518-d624b5c8ea46\', \'multiverseId\': 263313}, \'multiverseid\': 263313}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alabastermagier\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Schaden, der von der Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt ihren Beherrscher ebensoviele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Macht des Lichts und des Lebens sind uns heilig. Wahrheit und Ehre sind unsere besten Waffen." —Credo der Alabastermagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263626&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e4ad051-965b-4648-8897-c8554bf260b3\', \'multiverseId\': 263626}, \'multiverseid\': 263626}, {\'name\': \'Mago de alabastro\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: La criatura objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno. (El daño hecho por la criatura también hace que su controlador gane esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Creemos que los poderes de la luz y la vida son sagrados. La verdad y el honor son nuestras mejores armas." —Credo de alabastro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1482c816-843c-4158-b12c-dc67b8d15a03\', \'multiverseId\': 264871}, \'multiverseid\': 264871}, {\'name\': "Mage de l\'albâtre", \'text\': "{1}{W} : La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures infligées par la créature font aussi gagner autant de points de vie à son contrôleur.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Les pouvoirs de la lumière et de la vie nous sont sacrés. La vérité et l\'honneur sont nos armes les plus puissantes. » —Crédo de l\'albâtre", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5fc2a93-ef2c-4321-b17c-f61c82058d86\', \'multiverseId\': 263377}, \'multiverseid\': 263377}, {\'name\': \'Mago di Alabastro\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno inflitto dalla creatura fa anche guadagnare al suo controllore altrettanti punti vita.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Consideriamo sacri i poteri della luce e della vita. La verità e l\\\'onore sono le nostre armi principali." —Dottrina di Alabastro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06fd3df2-4a69-4563-b379-d8788ac2ad47\', \'multiverseId\': 263875}, \'multiverseid\': 263875}, {\'name\': \'雪花石の魔道士\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで絆魂を得る。 （このクリーチャーがダメージを与える場合、さらにそのコントローラーはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は光と生命の力を崇拝する。 真実と名誉こそが我々の最も偉大なる武器である。」 ――雪花石の教義\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc9f57f-8115-41a0-926d-9d6f3503b15b\', \'multiverseId\': 264124}, \'multiverseid\': 264124}, {\'name\': \'순백의 마도사\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 생명연결 능력을 얻는다. (생명연결을 가진 생물이 피해를 입히면, 그 생물의 조종자는 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 빛과 삶의 힘을 성스럽게 여기나니, 진실과 명예는 우리 최대의 무기이니라."—순백신조\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d62154-ec25-406a-8d7a-06075c23b0a8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Mago Alabastro\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: A criatura alvo que você controla ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno. (O dano causado pela criatura também faz com que seu controlador ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Os poderes da luz e da vida são sagrados para nós. A verdade e a honra são nossas maiores armas." — Crença Alabastro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5998034-d205-43dd-820a-de1d10efb317\', \'multiverseId\': 264373}, \'multiverseid\': 264373}, {\'name\': \'Алебастровый Маг\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: целевое существо под вашим контролем получает Цепь жизни до конца хода. (Повреждения, наносимые тем существом, также заставляют контролирующего его игрока получить такое же количество жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы свято чтим силы света и жизни. Правда и честь — наше величайшее оружие». — символ веры Алебастрового ордена\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c8479a1-6089-4617-8e17-874496b88e16\', \'multiverseId\': 264622}, \'multiverseid\': 264622}, {\'name\': \'洁白法师\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：目标由你操控的生物获得系命异能直到回合结束。 （此生物所造成的伤害会让其操控者获得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「光明与生命是我们坚守的力量。 真理与荣誉是我们最强的武器。」 ～洁白信条\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20505448-0227-4d30-9e17-e96644033b4c\', \'multiverseId\': 262879}, \'multiverseid\': 262879}, {\'name\': \'潔白法師\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：目標由你操控的生物獲得繫命異能直到回合結束。 （此生物所造成的傷害會讓其操控者獲得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「光明與生命是我們堅守的力量。 真理與榮譽是我們最強的武器。」 ～潔白信條\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fc4e3a3-aca7-4327-aaca-f662347e3dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 263128}, \'multiverseid\': 263128}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriffs-Greif\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'„Greifen dienen niemanden. Sie helfen freiwillig denjenigen, denen sie vertrauen." —Amira, Himmelskapitänin von Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263632&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19f801a7-6de0-40e7-b492-b53bca4ddb4b\', \'multiverseId\': 263632}, \'multiverseid\': 263632}, {\'name\': \'Grifo de asalto\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los grifos no son sirvientes. Ellos confían en alguien y le ayudan." —Amira, capitana celeste de Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f64f5d2d-0a4a-481d-8c19-82af5eda00fd\', \'multiverseId\': 264877}, \'multiverseid\': 264877}, {\'name\': "Griffon d\'assaut", \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : griffon\', \'flavor\': \'« Les griffons ne sont pas serviles. Ils donnent librement à ceux en qui ils ont confiance. » —Amira, capitaine céleste de Thiune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263383&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'062ee095-d2fa-4f78-809a-0f1df055549d\', \'multiverseId\': 263383}, \'multiverseid\': 263383}, {\'name\': "Grifone d\'Assalto", \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Grifone\', \'flavor\': \'"I grifoni non prestano servizio. Danno liberamente a coloro di cui si fidano." —Amira, capitano dei cieli di Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a32636b1-929a-4be3-b227-3687c04881d5\', \'multiverseId\': 263881}, \'multiverseid\': 263881}, {\'name\': \'突撃するグリフィン\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グリフィン\', \'flavor\': \'「グリフィンは仕える事はありません。 彼らは信用する者に惜しみなく与えるのです。」 ――テューンの飛空隊長、アミーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9032f86-07fa-4735-b0b6-8d4ee7eddae0\', \'multiverseId\': 264130}, \'multiverseid\': 264130}, {\'name\': \'유격 그리핀\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그리핀\', \'flavor\': \'"그리핀은 복종을 모릅니다. 믿는 자에게 베풀 뿐입니다."—쑨의 비행단장 아미라\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b627b97-cfbb-43a8-adda-07fa23ee1a2e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Grifo de Assalto\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'"Os grifos não são servos. Eles trabalham de graça para aqueles nos quais confiam." — Amira, capitã de aviação de Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d51d93cd-9049-4003-a1b7-584289a0ab85\', \'multiverseId\': 264379}, \'multiverseid\': 264379}, {\'name\': \'Штурмовой Грифон\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Грифон\', \'flavor\': \'«Грифоны никому не служат. Они безвозмездно помогают тем, кому доверяют». — Амира, небесный капитан из Туна\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cbe4866-5cb6-4c89-a764-ddfeeafbc87d\', \'multiverseId\': 264628}, \'multiverseid\': 264628}, {\'name\': \'突袭狮鹫\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～狮鹫\', \'flavor\': \'「狮鹫不服侍人。 他们是为所信任者付出。」 ～图恩空骑长爱米拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a54a2324-8ae0-4d9c-a2dd-5f9eeed2a0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 262885}, \'multiverseid\': 262885}, {\'name\': \'突襲獅鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～獅鷲\', \'flavor\': \'「獅鷲不服侍人。 牠們是為所信任者付出。」 ～圖恩空騎長愛米拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6667e92-0c29-4827-8677-f24d672d6655\', \'multiverseId\': 263134}, \'multiverseid\': 263134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nDie Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine hat zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen den bestimmten Kreaturentyp.\\nAndere Kreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Derartige Loyalität kann nur geschaffen sein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6165aa77-8b57-4118-8cf4-9b14a3a462bb\', \'multiverseId\': 263825}, \'multiverseid\': 263825}, {\'name\': \'Autómata adaptativo\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Autómata adaptativo entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nEl Autómata adaptativo es del tipo elegido además de sus otros tipos.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Tanta lealtad sólo puede ser creada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d3e095b-3a41-451e-9a81-195852dae904\', \'multiverseId\': 265070}, \'multiverseid\': 265070}, {\'name\': \'Automate évolutif\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Automate évolutif arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nL\'Automate évolutif a le type choisi en plus de ses autres types.\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez du type choisi gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Une telle fidélité ne peut être qu\'artificielle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263576&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e301ad5-c4dc-4d5e-a389-ae5b0007e0b3\', \'multiverseId\': 263576}, \'multiverseid\': 263576}, {\'name\': \'Automa Adattivo\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Automa Adattivo entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nL\'Automa Adattivo ha il tipo scelto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nLe altre creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Una tale fedeltà può essere solo creata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81a2c933-5a88-40cc-b9f8-6a90ff4e7b48\', \'multiverseId\': 264074}, \'multiverseid\': 264074}, {\'name\': \'順応する自動機械\', \'text\': \'順応する自動機械が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプを１つ選ぶ。\\n順応する自動機械は、それの他のタイプに加えてその選ばれたタイプでもある。\\nあなたがコントロールするその選ばれたタイプの他のクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'これほどの忠誠は作らねば手に入らない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473260e4-22b5-44b9-b1b0-f380e0647e43\', \'multiverseId\': 264323}, \'multiverseid\': 264323}, {\'name\': \'변신자동인형\', \'text\': \'변신자동인형이 전장에 들어올 시에, 당신은 생물 유형 한 가지를 선택한다.변신자동인형은 자체의 다른 유형에 더불어 선택된 유형이기도 하다.당신이 조종하는 선택된 유형의 다른 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'저런 충성심은 제조된 것일 수 밖에 없다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'554aca8a-e9ca-4e86-9c73-677c8bc0b4d7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Autômato Adaptável\', \'text\': \'Conforme Autômato Adaptável entra no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAutômato Adaptável é do tipo escolhido além de seus outros tipos.\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo escolhido que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Uma lealdade desse tipo só pode ser fabricada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debfbef6-42ce-471d-8b10-e2f8a43d9639\', \'multiverseId\': 264572}, \'multiverseid\': 264572}, {\'name\': \'Адаптивный Автомат\', \'text\': \'При выходе Адаптивного Автомата на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nАдаптивный Автомат обладает выбранным типом в дополнение к своим другим типам.\\nДругие находящиеся под вашим контролем существа выбранного типа получают +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Артефактное Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Такую преданность можно только смастерить.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6be2bda-7a1e-4d67-bc68-b6be03e91cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 264821}, \'multiverseid\': 264821}, {\'name\': \'适境机械兽\', \'text\': \'于适境机械兽进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n适境机械兽额外具有该类别。\\n其他由你操控的该类别生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'此等忠诚绝非天然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97de357f-c9ee-46e4-9afd-3e2f4d6b9880\', \'multiverseId\': 263078}, \'multiverseid\': 263078}, {\'name\': \'適境機械獸\', \'text\': \'於適境機械獸進戰場時，選擇一種生物類別。\\n適境機械獸額外具有該類別。\\n其他由你操控的該類別生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'此等忠誠絕非天然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4cf73b0-3a19-4f6c-8b18-69e387699230\', \'multiverseId\': 263327}, \'multiverseid\': 263327}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anschwellender Kriegssturm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt sie einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Lausche dem Grollen! Spüre den Donner! Der Immersturm brüllt mit jedem Blitz seine Zustimmung heraus!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263784&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9565f18-d1fb-45f7-ba8b-17c5fb1c1c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 263784}, \'multiverseid\': 263784}, {\'name\': \'Oleada de tormenta de guerra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, le hace daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Escuchen el rugido! ¡Sientan el trueno! ¡Immersturm grita su aprobación con cada relámpago!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2889a9b9-fb50-43e4-8583-7ef969ae63ac\', \'multiverseId\': 265029}, \'multiverseid\': 265029}, {\'name\': "Déferlement de l\'orage de guerre", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, elle inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal à sa force.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Écoutez son grondement ! Ressentez son tonnerre ! L\'Immersturm crie son approbation avec chacun de ses éclairs ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263535&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0733d42-aa0d-421b-9687-f4b993ce8174\', \'multiverseId\': 263535}, \'multiverseid\': 263535}, {\'name\': \'Scarica di Guerratempesta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ascoltate il rombo! Sentite il tuono! L\\\'Immersturm urla la sua approvazione con ogni fulmine!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cba319e9-8a9b-4345-95e8-8932fa75dbff\', \'multiverseId\': 264033}, \'multiverseid\': 264033}, {\'name\': \'戦嵐のうねり\', \'text\': \'いずれかのクリーチャーがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。その戦場に出たクリーチャーは、そのクリーチャーやプレイヤーに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「この叫びを聞け！ 雷を感じよ！ イマースタームは稲妻で応え叫んでいるぞ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'492d7e2d-5db5-4bba-92e9-b50ef4adf7a8\', \'multiverseId\': 264282}, \'multiverseid\': 264282}, {\'name\': \'전쟁폭풍의 해일\', \'text\': \'생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물 한 개나 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 그 목표에게 자체의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"저 울부짖음이 들리는가! 저 천둥이 느껴지는가! 내려치는 하나하나의 벼락이 바로 이머스트룸의 찬의다!"\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ebbbcc-bc87-473c-8554-4e31faf37217\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Surto da Tempestade Bélica\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, ela causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao seu poder à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Ouça o rugido! Sinta o trovão! O Immersturm manifesta sua aprovação com cada relâmpago!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba8a1e2-e1d7-476e-a565-dec57d8276cc\', \'multiverseId\': 264531}, \'multiverseid\': 264531}, {\'name\': \'Всплеск Бури Войны\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, оно наносит целевому существу или игроку повреждения, равные своей силе.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Слушайте его рев! Прочувствуйте его гром! Каждым ударом молнии Иммерштурм выражает свое одобрение!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d872915-24e8-4764-9869-1bfbd4caf5a2\', \'multiverseId\': 264780}, \'multiverseid\': 264780}, {\'name\': \'暴战翻腾\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物在你的操控下放进战场时，它对目标生物或牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于其力量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「听听这吼声！ 感受这雷鸣！ 无尽风暴的每声雷击都是在催促我们！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaefa1c1-307b-41bf-8b23-5332fbbc4dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 263037}, \'multiverseid\': 263037}, {\'name\': \'暴戰翻騰\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物在你的操控下放進戰場時，它對目標生物或玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於其力量。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「聽聽這吼聲！ 感受這雷鳴！ 無盡風暴的每聲雷擊都是在催促我們！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b88b6edb-e905-473e-999d-f49b8610e9f8\', \'multiverseId\': 263286}, \'multiverseid\': 263286}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arachnus-Spinner\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\nTappe eine nicht getappte Spinne, die du kontrollierst: Durchsuche deinen Friedhof und/oder deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Arachnusnetz und bringe sie an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl angelegt ins Spiel. Durchsuchst du dabei deine Bibliothek, mische sie danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263786&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2521133-4913-40a4-9ff7-c9e295302813\', \'multiverseId\': 263786}, \'multiverseid\': 263786}, {\'name\': \'Aracnus hiladora\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\nGirar una Araña enderezada que controles: Busca en tu cementerio y/o biblioteca una carta llamada Red de aracnus y ponla en el campo de batalla anexada a la criatura objetivo. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719e8375-5122-4f1b-bc8d-3b42c08081c1\', \'multiverseId\': 265031}, \'multiverseid\': 265031}, {\'name\': \'Fileuse arachnus\', \'text\': "Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\nEngagez une araignée dégagée que vous contrôlez : Cherchez dans votre cimetière et/ou votre bibliothèque une carte appelée Toile d\'arachnus et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille attachée à une créature ciblée. Si vous avez cherché dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263537&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f034591-1ce3-4447-adf5-9cf5a29e1272\', \'multiverseId\': 263537}, \'multiverseid\': 263537}, {\'name\': \'Filatrice Arachnus\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\nTAPpa un Ragno STAPpato che controlli: Passa in rassegna il tuo cimitero e/o grimorio per una carta chiamata Ragnatela Arachnus e mettila sul campo di battaglia assegnata a una creatura bersaglio. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19c622b8-8b4b-4a7b-bdc5-57d416b86ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 264035}, \'multiverseid\': 264035}, {\'name\': \'アラクナスの紡ぎ手\', \'text\': \'到達 （このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\nあなたがコントロールする蜘蛛を１体タップする：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたの墓地やライブラリーから「アラクナスの蜘蛛の巣」という名前のカードを１枚探し、それを戦場に出してそのクリーチャーにつける。 あなたがこれによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探した場合、それを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9714c60c-fcbf-4a9d-9610-a3de126ce685\', \'multiverseId\': 264284}, \'multiverseid\': 264284}, {\'name\': \'아라크네 방직거미\', \'text\': \'대공 (이 생물은 비행 능력을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)당신이 조종하는 언탭된 거미 한 개를 탭한다: 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 당신의 무덤 및 또는 서고에서 아라크네 거미줄이라 명명된 카드 한 장을 찾아 그 생물에 부착되도록 전장에 놓는다. 당신의 서고에서 그 카드를 찾아본다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거미\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f97d059-0c37-48bd-bd26-070e961ca15d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Fiandeira Aracnus\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\\nVire uma Aranha desvirada que você controla: Procure um card com o nome Teia de Aracnus no seu cemitério e/ou grimório e coloque-o no campo de batalha anexado à criatura alvo. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d67170bd-55c3-4904-8c84-940b89c71f44\', \'multiverseId\': 264533}, \'multiverseid\': 264533}, {\'name\': \'Арахнус-Прядильщик\', \'text\': \'Захват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\\nПоверните неповернутого Паука под вашим контролем: найдите на вашем кладбище и (или) в библиотеке карту с именем Паутина Арахнуса и положите ее на поле битвы, прикрепленной к целевому существу. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a21d58-97cc-42c6-9e16-de270b1fa084\', \'multiverseId\': 264782}, \'multiverseid\': 264782}, {\'name\': \'缠网蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'延势 （此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n横置一个由你操控且未横置的蜘蛛：从你的坟墓场和／或牌库中搜寻一张名称为蛛缠网的牌，将之放进战场并结附在目标生物上。 如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6235c95-4e4a-4415-9f23-2f5d8a5dafc4\', \'multiverseId\': 263039}, \'multiverseid\': 263039}, {\'name\': \'纏網蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'延勢 （此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\\n橫置一個由你操控且未橫置的蜘蛛：從你的墳墓場和／或牌庫中搜尋一張名稱為蛛纏網的牌，將之放進戰場並結附在目標生物上。 如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d0311db-e584-4a7b-8299-5c79681d593c\', \'multiverseId\': 263288}, \'multiverseid\': 263288}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arachnusnetz\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.\\nIst zu Beginn des Endsegments die Stärke der verzauberten Kreatur 4 oder höher, zerstöre das Arachnusnetz.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263787&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0892235a-2415-406b-a0be-2a854e619870\', \'multiverseId\': 263787}, \'multiverseid\': 263787}, {\'name\': \'Red de aracnus\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar o bloquear, y no pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si la fuerza de la criatura encantada es 4 o más, destruye la Red de aracnus.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e631cdb0-3615-4407-95d6-6fb4f10c90d9\', \'multiverseId\': 265032}, \'multiverseid\': 265032}, {\'name\': "Toile d\'arachnus", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si la force de la créature enchantée est supérieure ou égale à 4, détruisez la Toile d\'arachnus.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263538&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8cd119-d3cc-4c1e-82c2-534054921b98\', \'multiverseId\': 263538}, \'multiverseid\': 263538}, {\'name\': \'Ragnatela Arachnus\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.\\nAll\'inizio della sottofase finale, se la forza della creatura incantata è pari o superiore a 4, distruggi la Ragnatela Arachnus.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf98dd10-b3f1-4ca8-8eb8-c0b07e547438\', \'multiverseId\': 264036}, \'multiverseid\': 264036}, {\'name\': \'アラクナスの蜘蛛の巣\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは攻撃したりブロックしたりできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。\\n終了ステップの開始時に、エンチャントされているクリーチャーのパワーが４以上である場合、アラクナスの蜘蛛の巣を破壊する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3cf2d83-9b32-4039-b373-5203807d54f3\', \'multiverseId\': 264285}, \'multiverseid\': 264285}, {\'name\': \'아라크네 거미줄\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여부여된 생물은 공격할 수도 없고 방어할 수도 없으며, 부여된 생물의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다.종료단 시작에, 만약 부여된 생물의 공격력이 4 이상이라면, 아라크네 거미줄을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4a7cd5-31d5-46d8-bc78-2f64b91a9036\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Teia de Aracnus\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada não pode atacar nem bloquear e suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas.\\nNo início da etapa final, se o poder da criatura encantada for maior ou igual a 4, destrua Teia de Aracnus.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91fea9b6-d5e7-44d3-8099-0e0ae1d5b289\', \'multiverseId\': 264534}, \'multiverseid\': 264534}, {\'name\': \'Паутина Арахнуса\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо не может атаковать или блокировать, и его активируемые способности нельзя активировать.\\nВ начале заключительного шага, если сила зачарованного существа равна 4 или больше, уничтожьте Паутину Арахнуса.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6696d9e-f0f2-40b0-a0ff-9b0032cbfde3\', \'multiverseId\': 264783}, \'multiverseid\': 264783}, {\'name\': \'蛛缠网\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。\\n在结束步骤开始时，若所结附的生物之力量为4或更多，则消灭蛛缠网。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7402ec-cd36-4719-a786-91aa4abd8078\', \'multiverseId\': 263040}, \'multiverseid\': 263040}, {\'name\': \'蛛纏網\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物不能進行攻擊或阻擋，其起動式異能也不能起動。\\n在結束步驟開始時，若所結附的生物之力量為4或更多，則消滅蛛纏網。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3187fb-197f-4f3b-a66a-0bf52cca8209\', \'multiverseId\': 263289}, \'multiverseid\': 263289}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arbalestenelite\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: Die Arbalestenelite fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Die Arbalestenelite enttappt nicht während deines nächsten Enttappsegments.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt weniges, das so befriedigend klingen kann wie ein dumpfer Aufprall.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68054273-e0c7-4ecd-88bc-2c5e3349b814\', \'multiverseId\': 263629}, \'multiverseid\': 263629}, {\'name\': \'Élite de arbalestrilla\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: La Élite de arbalestrilla hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo. La Élite de arbalestrilla no se endereza durante tu próximo paso de enderezar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero humano\', \'flavor\': "Hay pocas cosas tan satisfactorias como un buen y saludable \'thunk\'.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed1ccbea-6e5f-4366-b576-6060b2304615\', \'multiverseId\': 264874}, \'multiverseid\': 264874}, {\'name\': "Arbalestrier d\'élite", \'text\': "{2}{W}, {T} : L\'Arbalestrier d\'élite inflige 3 blessures à la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée. L\'Arbalestrier d\'élite ne se dégage pas pendant votre prochaine étape de dégagement.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et archer\', \'flavor\': "Peu de choses sont plus satisfaisantes que le bruit mat d\'un carreau qui trouve sa cible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263380&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf30b19-7ed0-4518-be6e-c23cb32203b4\', \'multiverseId\': 263380}, \'multiverseid\': 263380}, {\'name\': \'Balestriere Scelto\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: Il Balestriere Scelto infligge 3 danni a una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio. Il Balestriere Scelto non STAPpa durante il tuo prossimo STAP.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Umano\', \'flavor\': "Esistono ben poche cose soddisfacenti come un bell\'impatto salutare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baa8489e-f15b-45d7-a469-1e6305c4cb66\', \'multiverseId\': 263878}, \'multiverseid\': 263878}, {\'name\': \'大石弓の精鋭\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}：攻撃かブロックしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。大石弓の精鋭はそれに３点のダメージを与える。 大石弓の精鋭はあなたの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・射手\', \'flavor\': \'素晴らしい弓のうなる音ほど満たされる物はめったに無い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'806d7f46-7258-42c2-94cc-b3dbd4029685\', \'multiverseId\': 264127}, \'multiverseid\': 264127}, {\'name\': \'대석궁 특등사수\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: 공격생물 한 개나 방어생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 대석궁 특등사수는 그 생물에게 피해 3점을 입힌다. 대석궁 특등사수는 당신의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 궁수\', \'flavor\': \'선명한 "푹" 소리만큼 만족스러운 것도 별로 없다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72112b10-3b68-4702-b3c3-a8ff60e379bb\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elite de Arbaleste\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: Elite de Arbaleste causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura atacante ou bloqueadora alvo. Elite de Arbaleste não desvira durante sua próxima etapa de desvirar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': \'Poucas coisas dão mais satisfação do que o som de uma flecha que atinge seu alvo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b2b871b-6ebd-4577-8456-ccad17f2791d\', \'multiverseId\': 264376}, \'multiverseid\': 264376}, {\'name\': \'Элитные Арбалетчики\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}: Элитные Арбалетчики наносят 3 повреждения целевому атакующему или блокирующему существу. Элитные Арбалетчики не разворачиваются во время вашего следующего шага разворота.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Лучник\', \'flavor\': \'Мало что приносит такое удовлетворение, как глухой щелчок правильно отпущенной тетивы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a29a6368-fa11-42f4-9bf9-910e87bad382\', \'multiverseId\': 264625}, \'multiverseid\': 264625}, {\'name\': \'弹簧弩精兵\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}，{T}：弹簧弩精兵对目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成3点伤害。 弹簧弩精兵于你的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'没什么东西比健康的好靶子更令人满足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc3d4131-b018-48d8-b543-a2ba577342fb\', \'multiverseId\': 262882}, \'multiverseid\': 262882}, {\'name\': \'彈簧弩精兵\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}，{T}：彈簧弩精兵對目標進行攻擊或阻擋的生物造成3點傷害。 彈簧弩精兵於你的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'沒什麼東西比健康的好靶子更令人滿足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ba33401-7689-4772-b557-ae95d38bc516\', \'multiverseId\': 263131}, \'multiverseid\': 263131}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon der Gerechtigkeit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Archon der Gerechtigkeit stirbt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'In dunklen Zeiten ist auch die Wahrheit bewaffnet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba825eaf-815e-471a-9a40-3a49619b0c12\', \'multiverseId\': 263630}, \'multiverseid\': 263630}, {\'name\': \'Arconte de justicia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Arconte de justicia muera, exilia el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'En tiempos oscuros, la Verdad blande una espada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c349e49-dfda-47bc-bc8f-69e1b71e84d2\', \'multiverseId\': 264875}, \'multiverseid\': 264875}, {\'name\': \'Archonte de la justice\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Archonte de la justice meurt, exilez un permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': \'Dans les périodes les plus noires, la Vérité doit être tranchante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263381&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89806291-05b0-4e94-aaee-fb38d52e954b\', \'multiverseId\': 263381}, \'multiverseid\': 263381}, {\'name\': \'Arconte della Giustizia\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Arconte della Giustizia muore, esilia un permanente bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Nei periodi più oscuri, la Verità brandisce una lama.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd6ed29f-3934-42aa-9120-02cba493afae\', \'multiverseId\': 263879}, \'multiverseid\': 263879}, {\'name\': \'正義の執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n正義の執政官が死亡したとき、パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'暗黒の時代には、真実は刃を帯びる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ea505e-3b78-4d82-98fa-07302a3422ab\', \'multiverseId\': 264128}, \'multiverseid\': 264128}, {\'name\': \'정의의 집정관\', \'text\': \'비행정의의 집정관이 죽을 때, 지속물 한 개를 목표로 정해서 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 집정관\', \'flavor\': \'어둠의 세상에서는 진리가 날을 세운다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2e10a0c-0e84-4069-9abc-94752ce780cd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Arconte da Justiça\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Arconte da Justiça morrer, exile a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Em tempos sombrios, a Verdade empunha uma espada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5220197e-97d6-4b16-b4cd-528bd921e8e4\', \'multiverseId\': 264377}, \'multiverseid\': 264377}, {\'name\': \'Архонт Правосудия\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Архонт Правосудия умирает, изгоните целевой перманент.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Архонт\', \'flavor\': \'В темные времена Правда обнажает меч.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d30d6e-acc0-4f11-a564-4f7f54f3a330\', \'multiverseId\': 264626}, \'multiverseid\': 264626}, {\'name\': \'正义统领\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当正义统领死去，放逐目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物～统领\', \'flavor\': \'在黑暗时代，真理得配剑出巡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd02535c-127a-4076-a01b-3f9f5bdbef67\', \'multiverseId\': 262883}, \'multiverseid\': 262883}, {\'name\': \'正義統領\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當正義統領死去，放逐目標永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物～統領\', \'flavor\': \'在黑暗時代，真理得配劍出巡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1831d424-432b-4f74-a1a1-80803dbfeef8\', \'multiverseId\': 263132}, \'multiverseid\': 263132}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auraschöpfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Auraschöpfer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„In unseren Erinnerungen finden wir die besten Stärkereserven."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263633&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89c0ea9b-3517-4dbb-9a57-91cb61d9f21b\', \'multiverseId\': 263633}, \'multiverseid\': 263633}, {\'name\': \'Auramante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Auramante entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"En nuestros recuerdos podemos encontrar nuestras mejores reservas de fuerza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa65e799-14e0-4a9d-993f-327017f914eb\', \'multiverseId\': 264878}, \'multiverseid\': 264878}, {\'name\': \'Auramancienne\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Auramancienne arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est dans les souvenirs que nous trouvons nos réserves de force les plus profondes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263384&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22558543-5baf-46c2-9f50-cfb607eb7799\', \'multiverseId\': 263384}, \'multiverseid\': 263384}, {\'name\': \'Animago\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Animago entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nei ricordi, possiamo trovare le nostre più profonde riserve di forze."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8acf8d0b-7370-469b-b9ca-ed2ebf335ca5\', \'multiverseId\': 263882}, \'multiverseid\': 263882}, {\'name\': \'オーラ術師\', \'text\': \'オーラ術師が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるエンチャント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたは、それをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「最も深くに蓄えられている力は、記憶の中にあります。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d8c8e51-270f-46d7-a39c-c8fc4d45d9f8\', \'multiverseId\': 264131}, \'multiverseid\': 264131}, {\'name\': \'부여술사\', \'text\': \'부여술사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 부여마법 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 추억 속에서 극한의 힘을 찾아냅니다."\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6393d058-3703-4783-9e61-aac94618d8f4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Auramante\', \'text\': \'Quando Auramante entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver o card de encantamento alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Nas memórias, encontramos nossas reservas mais profundas de energia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7286827c-cfb0-43ec-b88c-e5dc507d609e\', \'multiverseId\': 264380}, \'multiverseid\': 264380}, {\'name\': \'Ауромант\', \'text\': \'Когда Ауромант выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевую карту чар из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«В воспоминаниях можно найти глубочайшие запасы силы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375e18ff-cb2e-4fe4-b985-597646cd7f93\', \'multiverseId\': 264629}, \'multiverseid\': 264629}, {\'name\': \'灵气法师\', \'text\': \'当灵气法师进战场时，你可以将目标结界牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「在记忆中，我们能找到自己珍藏的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'372e1338-041b-4141-8342-c15839c11059\', \'multiverseId\': 262886}, \'multiverseid\': 262886}, {\'name\': \'靈氣法師\', \'text\': \'當靈氣法師進戰場時，你可以將目標結界牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「在記憶中，我們能找到自己珍藏的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'898c4dff-340e-4065-be27-bbec5f0a29f7\', \'multiverseId\': 263135}, \'multiverseid\': 263135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Grab holen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hör auf zu jammern. Du kannst schlafen, wenn du tot bist. Oh, tut mir Leid." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263717&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f5be093-1e04-4ab0-bd72-3cc87da7bd94\', \'multiverseId\': 263717}, \'multiverseid\': 263717}, {\'name\': \'Sacar de la tumba\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Deja de quejarte. Podrás descansar cuando estés muerto. Oh, lo siento." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abb20232-2cd1-4a3f-a642-0b4b168b8d1a\', \'multiverseId\': 264962}, \'multiverseid\': 264962}, {\'name\': \'Défouissage\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Cesse de te plaindre. Tu te reposeras quand tu seras mort. Oh — désolée. » —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45211b25-9cd1-4b17-823d-91e8144f18ba\', \'multiverseId\': 263468}, \'multiverseid\': 263468}, {\'name\': \'Dissotterrare\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Smettila di lamentarti. Potrai riposarti quando sarai morto. Oh... scusa." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b75b080-e2aa-4bc7-86df-aede8c75daf6\', \'multiverseId\': 263966}, \'multiverseid\': 263966}, {\'name\': \'墓暴き\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「文句を言うんじゃないよ。 死んだら楽になるんだから。 っと――ごめんね。」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeef7817-c004-431f-a0a2-f0d4fd838223\', \'multiverseId\': 264215}, \'multiverseid\': 264215}, {\'name\': \'무덤 파헤치기\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장을 목표로 정해서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그만 좀 투덜거려요. 쉬는 건 죽은 후에 마음껏 할 수 있잖아요? 아... 미안해요."—릴리아나 베스\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8c8844-bbfa-4813-9f86-4e3ac82a7246\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Desencovar\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Pare de reclamar. Você poderá descansar quando estiver morto. Ops! Desculpe." — Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83ea4026-11b5-4106-896c-f5667ac0b70a\', \'multiverseId\': 264464}, \'multiverseid\': 264464}, {\'name\': \'Извлечение из Могилы\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Хватит жаловаться. Отдохнешь, когда помрешь. Э-э... извини за неудачную шутку». — Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64e9535d-7083-42e7-8b20-500940aedb00\', \'multiverseId\': 264713}, \'multiverseid\': 264713}, {\'name\': \'扰坟\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「别抱怨了。 你死了就能休息。 啊～抱歉。」 ～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a4a07a-7814-4738-a996-2703845b1293\', \'multiverseId\': 262970}, \'multiverseid\': 262970}, {\'name\': \'擾墳\', \'text\': \'將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「別抱怨了。 你死了就能休息。 啊～抱歉。」 ～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c307f0b5-7cec-4364-99ad-c711ef2384ab\', \'multiverseId\': 263219}, \'multiverseid\': 263219}]', "[{'name': 'Ausgestoßene Vampire', 'text': 'Blutdurst 2 (Wurde einem Gegner in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt, kommt diese Kreatur mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nLebensverknüpfung (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vampir', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263739&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '134566e5-43ce-4017-927a-0d9c609c3162', 'multiverseId': 263739}, 'multiverseid': 263739}, {'name': 'Parias vampiro', 'text': 'Sed de sangre 2. (Si un oponente recibió daño este turno, esta criatura entra en juego con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nVínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa cantidad de vidas.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264984&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfd153c6-2544-4956-b614-89d8851ddc17', 'multiverseId': 264984}, 'multiverseid': 264984}, {'name': 'Proscrits vampires', 'text': 'Soif de sang 2 (Si un adversaire a subi des blessures ce tour-ci, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, deux marqueurs +1/+1.)\\nLien de vie (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)', 'type': 'Créature : vampire', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263490&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef7a82f9-ed33-467a-9d5a-ba8cd410538d', 'multiverseId': 263490}, 'multiverseid': 263490}, {'name': 'Vampiri Reietti', 'text': 'Sete di sangue 2 (Se a un avversario è stato inflitto danno in questo turno, questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.)\\nLegame vitale (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263988&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b240f12-fb6b-4ea3-b6dd-2a0c970fa277', 'multiverseId': 263988}, 'multiverseid': 263988}, {'name': '吸血鬼ののけ者', 'text': '狂喜２ （このターン、いずれかの対戦相手にダメージが与えられている場合、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る）\\n絆魂 （このクリーチャーがダメージを与える場合、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264237&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfc1642b-56c1-42f1-b39a-04beeca757de', 'multiverseId': 264237}, 'multiverseid': 264237}, {'name': '흡혈귀 방랑자들', 'text': '피굶주림 2 (어느 한 상대라도 이 턴에 피해를 입었다면, 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.)생명연결 (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 이 생물의 조종자는 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)', 'type': '생물 — 흡혈귀', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '944de8de-e943-4ded-aaaf-f5501b373b42'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Párias Vampiros', 'text': 'Sede de sangue 2 (Se um oponente tiver sofrido dano neste turno, esta criatura entrará no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1 sobre ela.)\\nVínculo com a vida (Dano causado por esta criatura faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264486&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca692a4e-67e1-40ce-9a35-1d7e25a71fa5', 'multiverseId': 264486}, 'multiverseid': 264486}, {'name': 'Вампиры-Изгои', 'text': 'Кровожадность 2 (Если оппоненту в этом ходу были нанесены повреждения, это существо выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.)\\nЦепь жизни (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)', 'type': 'Существо — Вампир', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264735&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3956211-6247-464b-91ed-1c5c85ff72a0', 'multiverseId': 264735}, 'multiverseid': 264735}, {'name': '受逐吸血鬼', 'text': '嗜血2 （如果对手本回合曾受过伤害，此生物进场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。）\\n系命 （此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262992&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '385fe044-dd05-4eae-8eb5-44fab4de8dfc', 'multiverseId': 262992}, 'multiverseid': 262992}, {'name': '受逐吸血鬼', 'text': '嗜血2 （如果對手本回合曾受過傷害，此生物進場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。）\\n繫命 （此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263241&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edc6a3f3-0bfc-4ac4-992c-f3302c18186f', 'multiverseId': 263241}, 'multiverseid': 263241}]", '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Flinkflügel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nFluchsicher (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Er war zu schnell, selbst für unsere erfahrenen Bogenschützen. Sie hätten ihm genausogut Handküsse hinterherwerfen können." —Vulok, Elfen-Bogenschütze\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263668&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d0c0128-b8fa-42a8-b106-110a3fb8d61e\', \'multiverseId\': 263668}, \'multiverseid\': 263668}, {\'name\': \'Aven alaveloz\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAntimaleficio. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlen tus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Era demasiado rápido, hasta para nuestros arqueros experimentados. Podrían haber estado enviándole saludos." —Vúlok, arquero élfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db953006-94f7-4e43-873a-b805279222f1\', \'multiverseId\': 264913}, \'multiverseid\': 264913}, {\'name\': \'Avemain ailevif\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nDéfense talismanique (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Il était trop rapide, même pour nos archers vétérans. Lui envoyer des baisers aurait été tout aussi efficace. » —Vulok, archer elfe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1360e73-de86-4d05-b61a-e603cb26577d\', \'multiverseId\': 263419}, \'multiverseid\': 263419}, {\'name\': \'Aviano Alaveloce\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nAnti-malocchio (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Era troppo veloce, anche per i nostri arcieri veterani. Era come se gli stessero mandando dei baci." —Vulok, arciere elfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20c31ada-4b0b-4e26-a174-148b081e2819\', \'multiverseId\': 263917}, \'multiverseid\': 263917}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの瞬翼\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n呪禁 （このクリーチャーは、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「そいつは我々の古参の射手にとっても素早すぎた。 投げキッスでもしてやった方がよかったかもな。」 ――エルフの射手、ヴァロック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'177f9c17-765d-4e63-ba19-b27e753b3e52\', \'multiverseId\': 264166}, \'multiverseid\': 264166}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 쾌속날개병\', \'text\': \'비행방호 (이 생물은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"고참 궁수도 따라잡지 못할 정도로 빠르더라고. 화살 대신 키스나 날려 주는 게 더 낫지 않았나 싶군."—엘프 궁수 불록\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd4ef81-450f-4d6a-ac70-b6692d1a492e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Asa-veloz Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nResistência à magia (Esta criatura alvo não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele foi rápido demais, até mesmo para nossos arqueiros veteranos. Se lhe atirassem beijos em vez de flechas daria no mesmo." — Vulok, arqueiro élfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1948c6c4-8591-4c92-b5e2-fe45d4d46259\', \'multiverseId\': 264415}, \'multiverseid\': 264415}, {\'name\': \'Быстрокрылый Авен\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nПорчеустойчивость (Это существо не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Он был слишком быстр, даже для наших лучников-ветеранов. С таким же успехом они могли посылать ему воздушные поцелуи». — Вулок, эльфийский лучник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc3cd2c1-c130-439a-b46b-61e7ed00b843\', \'multiverseId\': 264664}, \'multiverseid\': 264664}, {\'name\': \'迅翼艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n辟邪 （此生物不能成为由对手所操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「他实在太快，连我们的老牌箭手都射不中。 他们应该也已遭了他的殃。」 ～妖精箭手梧洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2645ac41-5273-44bc-959b-7cc57af785a7\', \'multiverseId\': 262921}, \'multiverseid\': 262921}, {\'name\': \'迅翼艾文\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n辟邪 （此生物不能成為由對手所操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「牠實在太快，連我們的老牌箭手都射不中。 他們應該也已遭了牠的殃。」 ～妖精箭手梧洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6523a147-5683-42a6-a185-fed644a2fbf3\', \'multiverseId\': 263170}, \'multiverseid\': 263170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azurmagier\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir holen unsere Macht aus dem unendlichen Ozean des Verstandes, wo alles Mögliche erdacht werden kann." —Credo der Azurmagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263669&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ff535a-5497-440f-ac4f-d4e4e7fa892b\', \'multiverseId\': 263669}, \'multiverseid\': 263669}, {\'name\': \'Maga de azur\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Obtenemos nuestro poder del océano infinito de la mente, donde todo tipo de cosas pueden ser concebidas." —Credo de azur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b991006-4b2c-46cf-894f-148778896d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 264914}, \'multiverseid\': 264914}, {\'name\': "Mage de l\'azur", \'text\': \'{3}{U} : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous tirons notre pouvoir de l\'océan infini de l\'esprit, où tout peut être conçu. » —Crédo de l\'azur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263420&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'600dc1fe-f30e-4343-b57e-c7afb599b9a4\', \'multiverseId\': 263420}, \'multiverseid\': 263420}, {\'name\': \'Maga Azzurra\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Traiamo il nostro potere dall\\\'infinito oceano della mente, dove ogni genere di cosa può essere concepita." —Dottrina Azzurra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0477d8f7-774b-40af-85df-a3d8e7a93592\', \'multiverseId\': 263918}, \'multiverseid\': 263918}, {\'name\': \'蒼穹の魔道士\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「我々はあらゆる考えが成される精神の無限の海より力を引き出す。」 ――蒼穹の教義\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'424d57b3-fe31-4488-94d1-c9a75861d849\', \'multiverseId\': 264167}, \'multiverseid\': 264167}, {\'name\': \'순청의 마도사\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마도사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 정신이라는 무한의 바다에서 힘을 끌어내나니, 그곳은 우주만물을 다 품을 수 있는 곳이니라."—순청신조\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa3ce44-83a8-4f97-a45d-dcde5fc765a5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Mago Lazur\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós extraímos nossa força do infinito oceano da mente, onde é possível conceber todo tipo de coisa." — Crença Lazur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8084fb16-7611-4e32-a99e-55c5413f6d2e\', \'multiverseId\': 264416}, \'multiverseid\': 264416}, {\'name\': \'Лазурный Маг\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы черпаем нашу силу из бездонного океана разума, способного породить даже самое невероятное». — символ веры Лазурного ордена\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09a30bc4-5d9b-49e9-8aa9-a7c82cf8a63f\', \'multiverseId\': 264665}, \'multiverseid\': 264665}, {\'name\': \'碧蓝法师\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们自心灵的无垠大海获取力量，万物秩序均构想自该处。」 ～碧蓝信条\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4b8e9b-6664-4dc7-8aa1-284518e885a3\', \'multiverseId\': 262922}, \'multiverseid\': 262922}, {\'name\': \'碧藍法師\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我們自心靈的無垠大海獲取力量，萬物秩序均構想自該處。」 ～碧藍信條\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e509480b-0960-45fe-877d-c8d8d3a99eca\', \'multiverseId\': 263171}, \'multiverseid\': 263171}]', '[{\'name\': \'Behütender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Behütende Engel ins Spiel kommt, ist eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl solange unzerstörbar, wie du den Behütenden Engel kontrollierst. (Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören diese bleibende Karte nicht. Eine unzerstörbare Kreatur kann nicht von Schaden zerstört werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263625&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86366600-5b45-4f63-8a73-6487eea13789\', \'multiverseId\': 263625}, \'multiverseid\': 263625}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la égida\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de la égida entre al campo de batalla, otro permanente objetivo es indestructible mientras controles el Ángel de la égida. (Los efectos que dicen "destruye" no destruyen ese permanente. Una criatura indestructible no puede ser destruida por daño.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cce58a0-0acd-4bf9-a6df-90da5256ab0b\', \'multiverseId\': 264870}, \'multiverseid\': 264870}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'égide", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange de l\'égide arrive sur le champ de bataille, un autre permanent ciblé est indestructible tant que vous contrôlez l\'Ange de l\'égide. (Les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne détruisent pas ce permanent. Une créature indestructible ne peut pas être détruite par des blessures.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263376&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe7e9202-7a81-48a4-a815-31c3707a52c6\', \'multiverseId\': 263376}, \'multiverseid\': 263376}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Egida", \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando l\\\'Angelo dell\\\'Egida entra nel campo di battaglia, un altro permanente bersaglio è indistruttibile fintanto che controlli l\\\'Angelo dell\\\'Egida. (Gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non distruggono quel permanente. Una creatura indistruttibile non può essere distrutta dal danno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4740fa6-9298-4693-a367-47e3b7923165\', \'multiverseId\': 263874}, \'multiverseid\': 263874}, {\'name\': \'神盾の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n神盾の天使が戦場に出たとき、他のパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたが神盾の天使をコントロールし続けているかぎり、それは破壊されない。 （"破壊する"と書かれた効果では、そのパーマネントは破壊されない。 破壊されないクリーチャーは、ダメージによって破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd5614d-c219-4ab6-a904-5b3bde5f01bc\', \'multiverseId\': 264123}, \'multiverseid\': 264123}, {\'name\': \'보호의 천사\', \'text\': \'비행보호의 천사가 전장에 들어올 때, 다른 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 당신이 보호의 천사를 조종하는 동안, 그 지속물은 파괴당할 수 없다. (파괴당할 수 없는 지속물은 "파괴"라고 명시된 효과로 파괴되지 않는다. 파괴당할 수 없는 생물은 피해에 의해 파괴되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4829eb0-fc5d-4d53-b2a8-4ff088df1202\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Égide\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo da Égide entrar no campo de batalha, outra permanente alvo será indestrutível enquanto você controlar Anjo da Égide. (Os efeitos que dizem "destrua" não destroem aquela permanente. Uma criatura indestrutível não pode ser destruída como resultado de dano.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf4b08a-d963-4930-b608-be7a647fcce5\', \'multiverseId\': 264372}, \'multiverseid\': 264372}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Эгиды\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Эгиды выходит на поле битвы, другой целевой перманент не может быть уничтожен, пока вы контролируете Ангела Эгиды. (Эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают тот перманент. «Неуничтожаемое» существо нельзя уничтожить повреждениями.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff13dcb-fb8c-43a1-8792-a820258b20ca\', \'multiverseId\': 264621}, \'multiverseid\': 264621}, {\'name\': \'庇护天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当庇护天使进战场时，只要你操控庇护天使，另一个目标永久物便不会毁坏。 （注明「消灭」的效应不会消灭该永久物。 伤害无法消灭不会毁坏的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0600975a-c56f-43fb-b167-7853a571b21b\', \'multiverseId\': 262878}, \'multiverseid\': 262878}, {\'name\': \'庇護天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當庇護天使進戰場時，只要你操控庇護天使，另一個目標永久物便不會毀壞。 （註明「消滅」的效應不會消滅該永久物。 傷害無法消滅不會毀壞的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b28701-ec86-4726-9bfa-b1b94d52fa9c\', \'multiverseId\': 263127}, \'multiverseid\': 263127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungs-Mastodon\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Mauern des Bösen werden fallen! Lasst die Belagerungsmaschinen auffahren. Wir ziehen in den Krieg!" —General Avitora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263658&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04d0f6d-cb80-45dd-beb2-ecf7178dda51\', \'multiverseId\': 263658}, \'multiverseid\': 263658}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte de asedio\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Los muros de los malvados caerán frente a nosotros. Preparen las armas de asedio. ¡Vamos a la guerra!" —General Avitora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5edaf2-a059-445b-9214-f4e0d91b90b3\', \'multiverseId\': 264903}, \'multiverseid\': 264903}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte de siège\', \'type\': \'Créature : éléphant\', \'flavor\': "« Les murailles du mal s\'effondreront devant nous. Préparez les machines de siège. Nous partons en guerre ! » —Général Avitora", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263409&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2320b13d-8076-4a22-bbe7-600c936beb92\', \'multiverseId\': 263409}, \'multiverseid\': 263409}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte da Assedio\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Le mura dei malvagi cadranno davanti a noi. Preparate le macchine da assedio. Andiamo alla guerra!" —Generale Avitora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9bacbed-bbf4-4c3c-a214-87940538208f\', \'multiverseId\': 263907}, \'multiverseid\': 263907}, {\'name\': \'包囲マストドン\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': \'「忌まわしき者の壁は必ずや落ちる。 攻城兵器を用意せよ。 戦場へ向かうぞ！」 ――アヴィトーラ将軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b613aa5-c365-4bf9-813e-634c59c0794e\', \'multiverseId\': 264156}, \'multiverseid\': 264156}, {\'name\': \'공성 마스토돈\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코끼리\', \'flavor\': \'"악한당의 벽은 우리 앞에 무너질 것이다. 공성 장비를 준비하라. 전군 앞으로!"—아비토라 장군\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5113d063-3bdd-449b-a215-8568ee01c85a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte do Cerco\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Os muros dos perversos cairão diante de nós. Preparem as armas de cerco. Vamos à guerra!" — General Avitora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dfc140b-f419-482d-bc4f-5c6e43b1e663\', \'multiverseId\': 264405}, \'multiverseid\': 264405}, {\'name\': \'Осадный Мастодонт\', \'type\': \'Существо — Слон\', \'flavor\': \'«Стены нечестивых падут под нашим натиском. Осадные машины — к бою! Приступаем к военным действиям!» — Генерал Авитора\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf18ad3a-94c0-49f1-a692-86b06dd82c23\', \'multiverseId\': 264654}, \'multiverseid\': 264654}, {\'name\': \'攻城乳齿象\', \'type\': \'生物～象\', \'flavor\': \'「恶人的墙壁将在我们面前倒塌。 备好攻城机械。 我们要上阵了！」 ～阿维托拉将军\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b617c1e7-bea7-46c9-8396-090013a58935\', \'multiverseId\': 262911}, \'multiverseid\': 262911}, {\'name\': \'攻城乳齒象\', \'type\': \'生物～象\', \'flavor\': \'「惡人的牆壁將在我們面前倒塌。 備好攻城機械。 我們要上陣了！」 ～阿維托拉將軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a67d3c5-588f-42e2-acb3-8d92db16396b\', \'multiverseId\': 263160}, \'multiverseid\': 263160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benalischer Veteran\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Benalische Veteran angreift, erhält er +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Eines Tages werde auch ich mein Haupt betten und meinen Kameraden ins Jenseits folgen, aber das kann warten, solange Abschaum wie ihr diese Welt regiert."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263634&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efd0c8d2-f814-4ea4-9683-fc0a7c03a18c\', \'multiverseId\': 263634}, \'multiverseid\': 263634}, {\'name\': \'Veterano benalita\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Veterano benalita ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Un día descansaré y me uniré a mis camaradas en el más allá, pero no mientras la basura como tú siga ensuciando este mundo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbae8ce6-71c1-484d-8f33-87e618cc40b8\', \'multiverseId\': 264879}, \'multiverseid\': 264879}, {\'name\': \'Vétéran bénalian\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Vétéran bénalian attaque, il gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Un jour je m\'assoupirai pour retrouver mes camarades dans l\'au-delà, mais pas tant que des rebuts de ton espèce souilleront encore ce monde. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e7239cb-d646-42d4-91d8-e3fff0f44bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 263385}, \'multiverseid\': 263385}, {\'name\': \'Veterano di Benalia\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Veterano di Benalia attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Un giorno mi riposerò e raggiungerò i miei compagni nell\\\'aldilà, ma non finché gentaglia come te continua a insudiciare questo mondo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b520a988-5233-4d5d-812e-3cb719dbd7cb\', \'multiverseId\': 263883}, \'multiverseid\': 263883}, {\'name\': \'ベナリアの古参兵\', \'text\': \'ベナリアの古参兵が攻撃するたび、それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「いつかはあの世で仲間と一緒に休めるんだろうが、お前のような屑がこの世界を汚しているうちはまだ無理だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b19d634-815e-444e-a868-dbcd4291a8a0\', \'multiverseId\': 264132}, \'multiverseid\': 264132}, {\'name\': \'베날리아 고참병\', \'text\': \'베날리아 고참병이 공격할 때마다, 베날리아 고참병은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"언젠간 나도 저 세상에서 전우를 만나 쉬겠지만, 너희같은 버러지들이 이 세상을 더럽히고 있는 한 쉴 생각은 조금도 없어."\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d5fb6a0-6020-4ccb-bbe5-e4442e97afe3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Veterano de Benália\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Veterano de Benália ataca, ele recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Um dia poderei repousar e unir-me aos meus camaradas na vida após a morte, mas não enquanto escórias como você ainda aviltarem este mundo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91844b9d-5f3f-49e6-9c8e-eeff66561e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 264381}, \'multiverseid\': 264381}, {\'name\': \'Беналийский Ветеран\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда Беналийский Ветеран атакует, он получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«В один прекрасный день я уйду на покой и присоединюсь к моим товарищам на том свете, но этот день не настанет, пока такая мразь, как ты, марает этот мир».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d085755e-8519-4f33-96e2-015edd0c6dab\', \'multiverseId\': 264630}, \'multiverseid\': 264630}, {\'name\': \'宾纳里亚老兵\', \'text\': \'每当宾纳里亚老兵攻击时，它得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我总有一天会停手，到来生与战友相聚；但得等到你们这些污染世界的混蛋全倒下才行。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ceeb2a-6f2c-4e10-be2b-df81abc3febc\', \'multiverseId\': 262887}, \'multiverseid\': 262887}, {\'name\': \'賓納里亞老兵\', \'text\': \'每當賓納里亞老兵攻擊時，它得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我總有一天會停手，到來生與戰友相聚；但得等到你們這些污染世界的混蛋全倒下才行。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cee6e0b-d151-4c1f-8ba3-ea4063d9970f\', \'multiverseId\': 263136}, \'multiverseid\': 263136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Betörende Sirene\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, greift dich in diesem Zug an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sirene\', \'flavor\': \'Sie lockt ihre Opfer mit fleischlichen Versprechungen an, verstrickt sie in einem Netz aus Verrat und ertränkt sie im Meer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263666&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9baf13e5-020d-4f56-b11b-8dbdffda9460\', \'multiverseId\': 263666}, \'multiverseid\': 263666}, {\'name\': \'Sirena tentadora\', \'text\': \'{T}: La criatura objetivo que controla un oponente te ataca este turno si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'Atrae a las víctimas con promesas carnales, los captura con una red de engaños y los destruye con el abrazo del mar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ef6144-1859-442b-a947-361479f1f4a1\', \'multiverseId\': 264911}, \'multiverseid\': 264911}, {\'name\': \'Sirène attirante\', \'text\': "{T} : La créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous attaque ce tour-ci si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature : sirène\', \'flavor\': "Elle attire ses victimes par des promesses charnelles, les capture dans un filet de déception et les détruit par l\'étreinte de la mer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263417&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bcba00c-634f-4e68-a746-23a29a397ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 263417}, \'multiverseid\': 263417}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Seducente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario ti attacca in questo turno, se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': "Adesca le vittime con promesse di carne, le cattura in una rete di inganni e le distrugge nell\'abbraccio del mare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd981e44-a528-4f7c-8406-9ffb2f7b413f\', \'multiverseId\': 263915}, \'multiverseid\': 263915}, {\'name\': \'魅惑するセイレーン\', \'text\': \'{T}：いずれかの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは可能ならあなたを攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — セイレーン\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は獲物を素肌の約束で誘惑し、嘘の網で捕らえ、海の抱擁で亡き者とする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e9ae53c-6b1e-4041-8637-66acf32a3467\', \'multiverseId\': 264164}, \'multiverseid\': 264164}, {\'name\': \'매혹적인 사이렌\', \'text\': \'{T}: 상대가 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 가능하면 당신을 공격해야 한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사이렌\', \'flavor\': \'그녀는 육체를 미끼로 사냥감을 유혹해, 거짓의 그물로 사로잡은 뒤 바다의 포옹으로 파멸시킨다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2403941-27c6-4dde-96f2-0b7396710f40\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Sedutora\', \'text\': \'{T}: A criatura alvo controlada por um oponente o ataca neste turno se estiver apta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'Ela seduz as vítimas com tentações mundanas, capturando-as numa rede de mentiras para depois destruí-las com o abraço do mar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15780350-9bfe-4d53-89d3-cfe7a50a3d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 264413}, \'multiverseid\': 264413}, {\'name\': \'Пленительная Сирена\', \'text\': \'{T}: целевое существо под контролем оппонента атакует вас в этом ходу, если может.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сирена\', \'flavor\': \'Она заманивает своих жертв обещаниями плотских утех, захватывает их в сети обмана и уничтожает их в объятиях моря.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6624e2-1a16-4afe-9e95-c1934bf18da3\', \'multiverseId\': 264662}, \'multiverseid\': 264662}, {\'name\': \'诱人塞连\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标由对手操控的生物本回合若能攻击你，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物～塞连\', \'flavor\': \'她拿身体诱惑对象，以欺瞒罗网捕获，并以大海之拥消灭他们。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd997d06-fd5d-4a6f-b6dc-4e34a23c2447\', \'multiverseId\': 262919}, \'multiverseid\': 262919}, {\'name\': \'誘人塞連\', \'text\': \'{T}：目標由對手操控的生物本回合若能攻擊你，則必須攻擊。\', \'type\': \'生物～塞連\', \'flavor\': \'她拿身體誘惑對象，以欺瞞羅網捕獲，並以大海之擁消滅他們。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0621dd9b-6771-4b88-95c6-3a86142c6180\', \'multiverseId\': 263168}, \'multiverseid\': 263168}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bidenhänder\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+0.\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Nur der tödliche Schlag zählt wirklich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fb6f872-846a-48a3-bd51-7861ccab34f3\', \'multiverseId\': 263833}, \'multiverseid\': 263833}, {\'name\': \'Espadón\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+0.\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este equipo a la criatura objetivo que controles. Juega la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'El único golpe que importa es el golpe final.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc9e5a4-a948-464b-b9eb-64a284043080\', \'multiverseId\': 265078}, \'multiverseid\': 265078}, {\'name\': \'Espadon\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +3/+0.\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez jouer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Le seul coup qui compte est celui qui tue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263584&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2530941-8b38-4a2e-b339-807d13164b28\', \'multiverseId\': 263584}, \'multiverseid\': 263584}, {\'name\': \'Spadone\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+0.\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Il solo colpo che conta è il colpo mortale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae97d35-1830-4cd4-b8b0-643716daca71\', \'multiverseId\': 264082}, \'multiverseid\': 264082}, {\'name\': \'大剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備 {3} ({3}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをつける。 装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'こいつの一撃は死の一撃だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd46fb24-88f8-49a0-ac05-9d0f2f777a59\', \'multiverseId\': 264331}, \'multiverseid\': 264331}, {\'name\': \'대검\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +3/+0을 받는다.장착 (: 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정해서 부착한다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화한다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'검에 있어 가장 중요한 것은 살상력이다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f40bac-3bba-4239-83c9-6bdf3f91cccf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Montante\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+0.\\nEquipar {3} ({3}: Anexe à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente quando puder jogar um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'O único golpe que conta é o golpe mortal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b299da2c-bd94-4257-93a1-e9d8eab9c4b4\', \'multiverseId\': 264580}, \'multiverseid\': 264580}, {\'name\': \'Двуручный Меч\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +3/+0.\\nСнарядить {3} ({3}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Единственный удар, который имеет значение, это смертельный удар.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe56580c-9f99-4e19-853a-b26d20992754\', \'multiverseId\': 264829}, \'multiverseid\': 264829}, {\'name\': \'巨剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+0。\\n佩带{3} （{3}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上； 佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'只有致命的一击才有意义。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e37052-d838-48a2-85dd-23b90cbfed1a\', \'multiverseId\': 263086}, \'multiverseid\': 263086}, {\'name\': \'巨劍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+3/+0。\\n佩帶{3} （{3}：裝備在目標由你操控的生物上； 佩帶的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'只有致命的一擊才有意義。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410b26c9-2a98-46dc-9b02-6f90b270e214\', \'multiverseId\': 263335}, \'multiverseid\': 263335}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blattern\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler verliert 1 Lebenspunkt, wirft eine Karte aus seiner Hand ab, opfert eine Kreatur und opfert dann ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Nimm ihnen ein paar Dinge weg, und sie werden rebellieren. Nimm ihnen alles weg, und sie werden es als Schicksal akzeptieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263732&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1a00cb9-399e-4868-a91d-d13e9c1b6db1\', \'multiverseId\': 263732}, \'multiverseid\': 263732}, {\'name\': \'Viruela\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador pierde 1 vida, descarta una carta, sacrifica una criatura y luego sacrifica una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Quítales algunas cosas, y puede haber una rebelión. Quítales todo, y la opresión será aceptada como su destino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda88258-df03-4827-acbb-2222c240841d\', \'multiverseId\': 264977}, \'multiverseid\': 264977}, {\'name\': \'Variole\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur perd 1 point de vie, se défausse d\'une carte, sacrifie une créature, puis sacrifie un terrain.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Retirez quelques privilèges et vous avez une rébellion. Retirez tout et l\'oppression sera acceptée comme le destin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc4c242-fb46-4e51-a980-c99fa837dee8\', \'multiverseId\': 263483}, \'multiverseid\': 263483}, {\'name\': \'Esantema\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore perde 1 punto vita, scarta una carta, sacrifica una creatura, poi sacrifica una terra.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Porta via poche cose e potrebbe derivarne una ribellione. Porta via tutto e l\'oppressione verrà accettata come destino.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d304422-9b5d-4f05-9f8a-6377e61fc943\', \'multiverseId\': 263981}, \'multiverseid\': 263981}, {\'name\': \'小悪疫\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、カードを１枚捨て、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げ、土地を１つ生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'幾ばくかを取り去れば、反逆が起こりえる。 全てを取り去れば、抑圧も宿命として受け入れられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afbb123b-1279-4559-8b57-793e7061b28e\', \'multiverseId\': 264230}, \'multiverseid\': 264230}, {\'name\': \'두창\', \'text\': \'각 플레이어는 생명 1점씩을 잃고, 카드 한 장씩을 버리고, 생물 한 개씩을 희생하고, 대지 한 개씩을 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'조금만 앗아가면 반란이 일어날 수 있지만, 전부를 앗아가면 탄압을 운명으로 받아들이게 할 수 있다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f154f29-2ab4-4eb2-a6c2-ae56c6612838\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Varicela\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador perde 1 ponto de vida, descarta um card, sacrifica uma criatura e depois sacrifica um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Leve algumas coisas e uma rebelião se seguirá. Leve tudo e a opressão será aceita como destino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fc01a84-f6cd-4743-ab00-b3575181dce3\', \'multiverseId\': 264479}, \'multiverseid\': 264479}, {\'name\': \'Оспа\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок теряет 1 жизнь, сбрасывает карту, жертвует существо, затем жертвует землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Отнимите немногое, и, возможно, это повлечет за собой бунт. Отнимите все, и гнет будет принят как судьба.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8cad699-ce96-415b-b3be-8271b982a408\', \'multiverseId\': 264728}, \'multiverseid\': 264728}, {\'name\': \'小片毒疹\', \'text\': \'每位牌手失去1点生命，弃一张牌，牺牲一个生物，然后牺牲一个地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'夺走一些东西，有可能激起反抗。 夺走一切东西，受压迫者会认命。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1934ae9f-5b5c-4937-96e4-858584862153\', \'multiverseId\': 262985}, \'multiverseid\': 262985}, {\'name\': \'小片毒疹\', \'text\': \'每位玩家失去1點生命，棄一張牌，犧牲一個生物，然後犧牲一個地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'奪走一些東西，有可能激起反抗。 奪走一切東西，受壓迫者會認命。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee6f4e65-3bd4-40ee-a483-7ae28b1795d4\', \'multiverseId\': 263234}, \'multiverseid\': 263234}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzeis\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen roten oder grünen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ob Kälte nur die Abwesenheit von Wärme oder eine Kraft für sich ist? Glaubst du es mir, wenn ich dir etwas vorführe?" —Zubarek, Eisformer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263676&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33beb987-49b6-4d00-a208-c4c81dcd5b1d\', \'multiverseId\': 263676}, \'multiverseid\': 263676}, {\'name\': \'Congelación repentina\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo rojo o verde.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Es el frío sólo la ausencia de calor, o una fuerza en sí mismo? ¿Te ayudaría a decidirte una muestra de su poder?" —Zubarek, Mago hieloveloz\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31c1512e-38c7-4831-ab4c-1001efc540f3\', \'multiverseId\': 264921}, \'multiverseid\': 264921}, {\'name\': \'Gel immédiat\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort rouge ou vert ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Le froid est-il seulement l\'absence de chaleur, ou une force à part entière ? » Une démonstration pourrait-elle vous aider à vous décider ? » —Zubarek, magus porteglace", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a4579a5-8b74-431d-bb36-64da6e6fedfd\', \'multiverseId\': 263427}, \'multiverseid\': 263427}, {\'name\': \'Gelolampo\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia rossa o verde bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il freddo è solo l\\\'assenza di calore o è una forza di per sé? Potrebbe una dimostrazione della sua potenza aiutarti nella decisione?" —Zubarek, Magus Torcighiaccio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d77038d0-fd65-47e7-bd33-c336e5035fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 263925}, \'multiverseid\': 263925}, {\'name\': \'瞬間凍結\', \'text\': \'赤か緑の呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「冷気とは単なる熱の欠落か、それとも力自身であるか？ その力を見せれば、お主にも判ろうか？」 ――氷巻の大魔術師、ズバレック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7828d11-b589-44a3-9ce5-7b40bdcd8cc1\', \'multiverseId\': 264174}, \'multiverseid\': 264174}, {\'name\': \'급속동결\', \'text\': \'적색이나 녹색 주문 한 개를 목표로 정해서 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"냉기가 단순히 열이 없는 상태인지, 독립적인 힘인지 궁금하다고? 너한테 실험해보면 답이 나오겠지?"—궐빙의 마도사 주바렉\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19db2e6c-41ce-48f6-941b-636c2e9f5b9b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Congelar Rápido\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo vermelha ou verde.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O frio é meramente a ausência de calor ou uma força propriamente dita? Quer uma demonstração para ajudá-lo a decidir?" — Zubarek, Mago Torce-gelo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba512581-670b-4fed-b46b-eddc62838c66\', \'multiverseId\': 264423}, \'multiverseid\': 264423}, {\'name\': \'Мгновенная Заморозка\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое красное или зеленое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Холод — это всего лишь отсутствие тепла или же самостоятельная сила? Может, демонстрация его могущества подтолкнет вас к правильному ответу?» — Зубарек, волхв ледяных превращений\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14608609-1871-4ad1-af88-5450703c6b1d\', \'multiverseId\': 264672}, \'multiverseid\': 264672}, {\'name\': \'快速冻结\', \'text\': \'反击目标红色或绿色咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「寒冷是否仅为热气流失的现象，或者它本身就是一股力量？ 要不要展现一下其力量来帮你做出判断？」 ～冰风贤者祖巴冽\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20f186e6-61d3-4f29-98e8-7da14ea1e4cb\', \'multiverseId\': 262929}, \'multiverseid\': 262929}, {\'name\': \'快速凍結\', \'text\': \'反擊目標紅色或綠色咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「寒冷是否僅為熱氣流失的現象，或者它本身就是一股力量？ 要不要展現一下其力量來幫你做出判斷？」 ～冰風賢者祖巴冽\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11bdf15b-c865-4af7-8ea1-6728e1cd5637\', \'multiverseId\': 263178}, \'multiverseid\': 263178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzelementar\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Oh, man kann es ganz einfach töten, aber ich werde mich ihm niemals soweit nähern." —Norin der Vorsichtige\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263773&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'341d4480-ec5e-4b5a-9e25-cf02143e3f10\', \'multiverseId\': 263773}, \'multiverseid\': 263773}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de rayos\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entre bajo tu control.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, es muy fácil matarlo, pero yo no me voy a acercar a él." —Norin el Precavido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4b90435-a761-44ba-aa35-02aaddc26222\', \'multiverseId\': 265018}, \'multiverseid\': 265018}, {\'name\': "Élémental d\'éclair", \'text\': \'Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Oh, c\'est facile de le tuer, mais je n\'ai aucune intention de m\'en approcher. » —Norin le circonspect", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b65ca6-205d-4cb5-98cb-d25af2b018a4\', \'multiverseId\': 263524}, \'multiverseid\': 263524}, {\'name\': \'Elementale dei Fulmini\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, è abbastanza facile da uccidere, ma non ci penso proprio ad avvicinarmi." —Norin il Diffidente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'056edc24-9695-41ec-8ea2-de3679109d87\', \'multiverseId\': 264022}, \'multiverseid\': 264022}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の精霊\', \'text\': \'速攻 （このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「まあ、殺すのは簡単さ。近づくつもりは無いけどね。」 ――二の足踏みのノリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d7fc81-7988-4cb0-8285-3c4909e1b1bc\', \'multiverseId\': 264271}, \'multiverseid\': 264271}, {\'name\': \'번개의 정령\', \'text\': \'신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격할 수도 있고 할 수도 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"까짓것. 죽이는 거야 쉽지만, 다가갈 생각은 죽어도 없다구."—겁보 노린\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248a0dee-f537-4791-816d-01eae78a284c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental do Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que entra sob seu controle.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, ele é bem fácil de matar, mas eu não quero nem chegar perto." — Norin, o Cauteloso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'231deb92-0d7e-4ae6-a2e0-f541f8f207c7\', \'multiverseId\': 264520}, \'multiverseid\': 264520}, {\'name\': \'Элементаль Молний\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Убить его достаточно просто, но приближаться к нему я не собираюсь». — Норин Опасливый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33dee699-60eb-4d3b-9f68-2897636a583c\', \'multiverseId\': 264769}, \'multiverseid\': 264769}, {\'name\': \'闪电元素\', \'text\': \'敏捷 （此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「喔，要杀它很简单，但我可不想靠近。」 ～谨慎的诺林\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f72d9904-00bc-4cfc-8f68-c53a4264774a\', \'multiverseId\': 263026}, \'multiverseid\': 263026}, {\'name\': \'閃電元素\', \'text\': \'敏捷 （此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「喔，要殺它很簡單，但我可不想靠近。」 ～謹慎的諾林\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b149ab8d-4cbb-41e9-b11c-a916871f59f8\', \'multiverseId\': 263275}, \'multiverseid\': 263275}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutbadwurm\', \'text\': \'Blutdurst 3 (Wurde einem Gegner in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt, kommt diese Kreatur mit drei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden (Falls diese Kreatur ihren Blockern genug Schaden zuweisen würde, um sie zu zerstören, kannst du sie den Rest des Schadens dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zuweisen lassen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263792&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4d9b52-bb9b-4d58-aa29-a0ee2c5b242a\', \'multiverseId\': 263792}, \'multiverseid\': 263792}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe de la matanza\', \'text\': \'Sed de sangre 3. (Si un oponente recibió daño este turno, esta criatura entra en juego con tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nArrolla. (Si esta criatura fuera a asignar suficiente daño a sus bloqueadores como para destruirlos, puedes hacer que le asigne el resto del daño al jugador o planeswalker defensor.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92823fbf-0c21-4f60-ba96-aa9391f7120c\', \'multiverseId\': 265037}, \'multiverseid\': 265037}, {\'name\': \'Guivre du carnage\', \'text\': "Soif de sang 3 (Si un adversaire a subi des blessures ce tour-ci, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, trois marqueurs +1/+1.)\\nPiétinement (Si cette créature attribue suffisamment de blessures de combat à ses bloqueurs pour les détruire, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle attribue le reste de ses blessures au joueur ou au planeswalker défenseur.)", \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263543&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec3db012-c155-455e-97be-e4efa833ec0a\', \'multiverseId\': 263543}, \'multiverseid\': 263543}, {\'name\': \'Wurm del Massacro\', \'text\': \'Sete di sangue 3 (Se a un avversario è stato inflitto danno in questo turno, questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini +1/+1.)\\nTravolgere (Se questa creatura sta per assegnare alle sue creature bloccanti danno sufficiente a distruggerle, puoi farle assegnare il resto del suo danno al giocatore in difesa o a un planeswalker.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e12306bb-9532-4e0e-8196-40806ddb3896\', \'multiverseId\': 264041}, \'multiverseid\': 264041}, {\'name\': \'殺戮のワーム\', \'text\': \'狂喜３ （このターン、いずれかの対戦相手にダメージが与えられている場合、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る）トランプル\\n （このクリーチャーが、自身をブロックしているすべてのクリーチャーを破壊するのに十分なダメージを割り振る場合、あなたはそれの残りのダメージを防御プレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに割り振ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6db41a-e3b3-4dae-a409-8c3dfa4852e8\', \'multiverseId\': 264290}, \'multiverseid\': 264290}, {\'name\': \'살육의 웜\', \'text\': \'피굶주림 3 (어느 한 상대라도 이 턴에 피해를 입었다면, 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.)돌진 (이 생물이 자체의 모든 방어자를 파괴할 만큼의 피해를 배정한다면, 당신은 수비플레이어나 수비플레인즈워커에게 이 생물의 나머지 피해를 배정할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3c464b1-d35f-4ec5-bd66-9fcee701fd89\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vorme da Carnificina\', \'text\': \'Sede de sangue 3 (Se um oponente tiver sofrido dano neste turno, esta criatura entrará no campo de batalha com três marcadores +1/+1 sobre ela.)\\nAtropelar (Se esta criatura fosse atribuir dano suficiente para destruir seus bloqueadores, você pode fazer com que ela atribua o resto de seu dano ao planeswalker ou jogador defensor.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b794dca-235c-4394-b0f1-5248785ea580\', \'multiverseId\': 264539}, \'multiverseid\': 264539}, {\'name\': \'Вурм Резни\', \'text\': \'Кровожадность 3 (Если оппоненту в этом ходу были нанесены повреждения, это существо выходит на поле битвы с тремя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.)\\nПробивной удар (Если это существо распределяет достаточно повреждений, чтобы уничтожить блокирующие его существа, вы можете заставить его распределить оставшиеся повреждения защищающемуся игроку или planeswalker-у.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4bcb90a-5ccc-4c47-bb56-d961345f2b81\', \'multiverseId\': 264788}, \'multiverseid\': 264788}, {\'name\': \'屠戮亚龙\', \'text\': \'嗜血3 （如果对手本回合曾受过伤害，此生物进场时上面有三个+1/+1指示物。）\\n践踏 （如果此生物将分配的伤害足以消灭所有阻挡它的生物，你可以将它所剩余数量的伤害分配给防御牌手或鹏洛客。）\', \'type\': \'生物～亚龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b85553a-9b3b-4f36-b741-fb85edaf7816\', \'multiverseId\': 263045}, \'multiverseid\': 263045}, {\'name\': \'屠戮亞龍\', \'text\': \'嗜血3 （如果對手本回合曾受過傷害，此生物進場時上面有三個+1/+1指示物。）\\n踐踏 （如果此生物將分配的傷害足以消滅所有阻擋它的生物，你可以將它所剩餘數量的傷害分配給防禦玩家或鵬洛客。）\', \'type\': \'生物～亞龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16235f1e-80f2-4077-8889-c93b46e15bb4\', \'multiverseId\': 263294}, \'multiverseid\': 263294}]', "[{'name': 'Blutfürst von Vaasgoth', 'text': 'Blutdurst 3 (Wurde einem Gegner in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt, kommt diese Kreatur mit drei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Vampir-Kreaturenzauber wirkst, erhält dieser Blutdurst 3.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263706&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c13e752-2088-401e-ac93-179ccfff61ff', 'multiverseId': 263706}, 'multiverseid': 263706}, {'name': 'Señor sangriento de Vaasgoth', 'text': 'Sed de sangre 3. (Si un oponente recibió daño este turno, esta criatura entra en juego con tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura Vampiro, gana sed de sangre 3.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264951&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '942767c6-5695-4e9e-9bef-e208f304e9c6', 'multiverseId': 264951}, 'multiverseid': 264951}, {'name': 'Seigneur de sang de Vaäsgoth', 'text': 'Soif de sang 3 (Si un adversaire a subi des blessures ce tour-ci, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, trois marqueurs +1/+1.)\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature Vampire, il acquiert soif de sang 3.', 'type': 'Créature : vampire et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263457&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10c5ca0d-647c-4f9c-b6ca-47a27a0cbc65', 'multiverseId': 263457}, 'multiverseid': 263457}, {'name': 'Signore Sanguinario di Vaasgoth', 'text': 'Sete di sangue 3 (Se a un avversario è stato inflitto danno in questo turno, questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini +1/+1.)\\nVolare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura Vampiro, ha sete di sangue 3.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Vampiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263955&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79a415c1-b31a-457f-84f4-387fde99cc9c', 'multiverseId': 263955}, 'multiverseid': 263955}, {'name': 'ヴァーズゴスの血王', 'text': '狂喜３ （このターン、いずれかの対戦相手にダメージが与えられている場合、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）飛行\\nあなたがいずれかの吸血鬼・クリーチャー呪文を唱えるたび、それは狂喜３を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264204&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '369ee47e-dbe9-4e36-89f6-d72f80aa8205', 'multiverseId': 264204}, 'multiverseid': 264204}, {'name': '바즈고스의 혈군주', 'text': '피굶주림 3 (어느 한 상대라도 이 턴에 피해를 입었다면, 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.)비행당신이 흡혈귀 생물 주문을 발동할 때마다, 그 주문은 피굶주림 3 능력을 얻는다.', 'type': '생물 — 흡혈귀 전사', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b57b9450-0b0d-4360-8506-db4a2fa0a29b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Senhor Vampiro de Vaasgoth', 'text': 'Sede de sangue 3 (Se um oponente tiver sofrido dano neste turno, esta criatura entrará no campo de batalha com três marcadores +1/+1 sobre ela.)\\nVoar\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica de criatura do tipo Vampiro, ela ganha sede de sangue 3.', 'type': 'Criatura — Vampiro Guerreiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264453&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a3a8a92-20f3-455d-8dca-ee49122294c8', 'multiverseId': 264453}, 'multiverseid': 264453}, {'name': 'Кровавый Лорд Ваазгота', 'text': 'Кровожадность 3 (Если оппоненту в этом ходу были нанесены повреждения, это существо выходит на поле битвы с тремя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.)\\nПолет\\nКаждый раз когда вы разыгрываете заклинание существа-Вампира, оно получает Кровожадность 3.', 'type': 'Существо — Вампир Воин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264702&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7e40dcf-ab71-424d-a529-35e574de71af', 'multiverseId': 264702}, 'multiverseid': 264702}, {'name': '法兹各血领', 'text': '嗜血3 （如果对手本回合曾受过伤害，此生物进场时上面有三个+1/+1指示物。）\\n飞行\\n每当你施放一个吸血鬼生物咒语时，它获得嗜血3。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262959&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb8bb6c4-f6d0-4815-85bb-39ce2d0b6d68', 'multiverseId': 262959}, 'multiverseid': 262959}, {'name': '法茲各血領', 'text': '嗜血3 （如果對手本回合曾受過傷害，此生物進場時上面有三個+1/+1指示物。）\\n飛行\\n每當你施放一個吸血鬼生物咒語時，它獲得嗜血3。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼／戰士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263208&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69d060c4-46b3-40df-9ba6-c3dc81f32789', 'multiverseId': 263208}, 'multiverseid': 263208}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutgeschmack\', \'text\': \'Der Blutgeschmack fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie gesegnet müssen manche Leute sein, deren Leben keine Ängste, keine Scheu kennt, für die Schlaf ein Segen ist, der jeden Abend kommt und nichts als süße Träume bringt." —Bram Stoker, Dracula\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263737&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe333af-a0d8-493e-bb1a-6611b413c7d9\', \'multiverseId\': 263737}, \'multiverseid\': 263737}, {\'name\': \'Probar la sangre\', \'text\': \'Probar la sangre hace 1 punto de daño al jugador objetivo y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Qué agraciados algunos, cuyas vidas transcurren sin temores, sin miedos, para quienes dormir es una bendición que reciben todas las noches, y trae dulces sueños." —Bram Stoker, Drácula\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'611ddf8d-e1d3-46bf-b95e-63aaddc4fc53\', \'multiverseId\': 264982}, \'multiverseid\': 264982}, {\'name\': \'Goût du sang\', \'text\': \'Le Goût du sang inflige 1 blessure à un joueur ciblé et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'ils sont heureux ceux qui ne craignent, ne redoutent jamais rien, qui s\'endorment tous les soirs d\'un sommeil réparateur peuplé uniquement de rêves doux et paisibles ! » —Bram Stoker, Dracula", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263488&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5ca3219-0754-4216-aeb0-5f852a9c0752\', \'multiverseId\': 263488}, \'multiverseid\': 263488}, {\'name\': \'Assaggio di Sangue\', \'text\': "L\'Assaggio di Sangue infligge 1 danno a un giocatore bersaglio e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Quanto sono fortunate alcune persone, le cui vite non hanno paure, né timori, per le quali il sonno è una benedizione che giunge di notte e porta solo dolci sogni." —Bram Stoker, Dracula\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7905389c-954f-4232-9d62-641c3b89acc4\', \'multiverseId\': 263986}, \'multiverseid\': 263986}, {\'name\': \'血の味\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。血の味はそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与え、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「幾ばくかの祝福されし者達よ。恐れ無く、不安無く、毎夜来る眠りは祝福を受け、そこには甘やかな夢以外の何物も無し。」 ――ブラム・ストーカー「吸血鬼ドラキュラ」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8729b590-5774-4956-be42-90a732899b3f\', \'multiverseId\': 264235}, \'multiverseid\': 264235}, {\'name\': \'피의 맛\', \'text\': \'플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 피의 맛은 그 플레이어에게 피해 1점을 입히고, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"공포도 두려움도 없는 삶에, 밤이면 찾아오는 달콤한 꿈만을 나르는 축복의 잠까지, 이 얼마나 축복받은 사람들인가."브램 스토커 저, 드라큘라\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada187f8-071b-49d0-a151-faa726807304\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Gosto de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Gosto de Sangue causa 1 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Como são abençoadas certas pessoas, em cujas vidas não há medos, nem receios, para as quais dormir é uma bênção que recebem a cada noite, e que não traz nada além de bons sonhos." — Bram Stoker, Drácula\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6806349-d027-49c4-b333-9f5627c54fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 264484}, \'multiverseid\': 264484}, {\'name\': \'Вкус Крови\', \'text\': \'Вкус Крови наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Как счастливы те, чья жизнь проходит без страха, без ужасов, для кого сон является благословением ночи и не приносит ничего, кроме сладких сновидений». — Брэм Стокер, Дракула\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe41d11-edba-4f98-85aa-c3ddfb94ad63\', \'multiverseId\': 264733}, \'multiverseid\': 264733}, {\'name\': \'尝血之乐\', \'text\': \'尝血之乐对目标牌手造成1点伤害，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「那些生活没有恐惧、没有担忧，每晚都能愉快享受睡眠与美梦的人，是多么地幸福啊。」 ～伯兰．史杜克，《吸血鬼》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6260ac25-1f34-4e28-9ada-ce1da6cddae8\', \'multiverseId\': 262990}, \'multiverseid\': 262990}, {\'name\': \'嚐血之樂\', \'text\': \'嚐血之樂對目標玩家造成1點傷害，且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「那些生活沒有恐懼、沒有擔憂，每晚都能愉快享受睡眠與美夢的人，是多麼地幸福啊。」 ～伯蘭‧史杜克，《吸血鬼》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29f08e32-8482-4d23-a69b-b6b0f982d2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 263239}, \'multiverseid\': 263239}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bluthorn-Minotauren\', \'text\': \'Blutdurst 2 (Wurde einem Gegner in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt, kommt diese Kreatur mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Einige der elf Minotauren-Clans von Mirtiin sind herausragende Handwerker oder gelehrte Philosophen. Andere hauen am liebsten einfach nur drauf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263768&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931f54b1-5c05-4147-9f5d-fd90e91b5553\', \'multiverseId\': 263768}, \'multiverseid\': 263768}, {\'name\': \'Minotauros Cuernos Sangrientos\', \'text\': \'Sed de sangre 2. (Si un oponente recibió daño este turno, esta criatura entra en juego con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos de los once clanes de minotauros de Mirtiin son artesanos expertos y filósofos eruditos. A otros les justa simplemente golpear cosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61009e2-0f57-40a4-919b-7344e985b44f\', \'multiverseId\': 265013}, \'multiverseid\': 265013}, {\'name\': \'Minotaures corneboyaux\', \'text\': \'Soif de sang 2 (Si un adversaire a subi des blessures ce tour-ci, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, deux marqueurs +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Parmi les onze clans minotaures de Mirtiin, on compte des experts en artisanat et des philosophes accomplis. D\'autres aiment tout simplement taper.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05a3d844-2897-41f7-8019-7843a1b9ce62\', \'multiverseId\': 263519}, \'multiverseid\': 263519}, {\'name\': \'Minotauri da Incornata\', \'text\': \'Sete di sangue 2 (Se a un avversario è stato inflitto danno in questo turno, questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni degli undici clan minotauri di Mirtiin sono artigiani esperti e filosofi istruiti. Altri semplicemente amano colpire tutto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c3ea36-10fd-4a75-b5d9-59d7fd38d6f2\', \'multiverseId\': 264017}, \'multiverseid\': 264017}, {\'name\': \'血まみれ角のミノタウルス\', \'text\': \'狂喜２ （このターン、いずれかの対戦相手にダメージが与えられている場合、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'ミルティーンのミノタウルスの十一の氏族の中には、手工芸の達人もいれば、博学の哲学者もいる。 残りは全部殴り担当だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c00d7049-1cb7-4e9d-a8cb-6d8ee2c22526\', \'multiverseId\': 264266}, \'multiverseid\': 264266}, {\'name\': \'응혈각 미노타우로스들\', \'text\': \'피굶주림 2 (어느 한 상대라도 이 턴에 피해를 입었다면, 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스 전사\', \'flavor\': \'미르틴의 열 한 미노타우로스 부족 중 일부에는 일류 기술자들도 있고 박식한 철학자들도 있다. 나머지는 무엇이든 들이받는 걸 좋아할 뿐이다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36c12f3a-bf45-4748-8770-7f5bfbdc8c92\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Minotauros dos Chifres Escorneadores\', \'text\': \'Sede de sangue 2 (Se um oponente tiver sofrido dano neste turno, esta criatura entrará no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1 sobre ela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns dos onze clãs de minotauros de Mirtiin são artesãos experientes e filósofos sábios. Outros gostam apenas de golpear coisas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'872c662d-978f-49d0-ba5f-e336fcb24237\', \'multiverseId\': 264515}, \'multiverseid\': 264515}, {\'name\': \'Кроваворогие Минотавры\', \'text\': \'Кровожадность 2 (Если оппоненту в этом ходу были нанесены повреждения, это существо выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые минотавры из одинадцати кланов Миртиина — искусные умельцы и ученые философы. Остальные же просто любят драться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42d13cb4-6da3-45b3-9fed-e0f550c47b93\', \'multiverseId\': 264764}, \'multiverseid\': 264764}, {\'name\': \'血角牛头怪\', \'text\': \'嗜血2 （如果对手本回合曾受过伤害，此生物进场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'米尔丁十一个牛头怪部族之中，有些是专门的工匠与知识丰富的学者。 其他的只爱打东西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c82f627e-622e-484f-a36b-6cf754504b41\', \'multiverseId\': 263021}, \'multiverseid\': 263021}, {\'name\': \'血角牛頭怪\', \'text\': \'嗜血2 （如果對手本回合曾受過傷害，此生物進場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～牛頭怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'米爾丁十一個牛頭怪部族之中，有些是專門的工匠與知識豐富的學者。 其他的只愛打東西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e6486b6-df13-424e-9ef4-caefc01f863d\', \'multiverseId\': 263270}, \'multiverseid\': 263270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutoger\', \'text\': \'Blutdurst 1 (Wurde einem Gegner in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt, kommt diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.)\\nErstschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt Kampfschaden vor Kreaturen ohne Erstschlag zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263746&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f69215a-c099-4864-86a9-d0e4ae8f3616\', \'multiverseId\': 263746}, \'multiverseid\': 263746}, {\'name\': \'Ogro sangriento\', \'text\': \'Sed de sangre 1. (Si un oponente recibió daño este turno, esta criatura entra en juego con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nDaña primero. (Esta criatura hace daño de combate antes que las criaturas sin la habilidad de dañar primero.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ogro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'405fbea6-5dbc-418f-b9fa-d73b69556be0\', \'multiverseId\': 264991}, \'multiverseid\': 264991}, {\'name\': \'Ogre de sang\', \'text\': "Soif de sang 1 (Si un adversaire a subi des blessures ce tour-ci, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1.)\\nInitiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat avant les créatures sans l\'initiative.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263497&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f873d5fd-eeb2-4b29-b98d-5e433bda1c0f\', \'multiverseId\': 263497}, \'multiverseid\': 263497}, {\'name\': \'Ogre del Sangue\', \'text\': \'Sete di sangue 1 (Se a un avversario è stato inflitto danno in questo turno, questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.)\\nAttacco improvviso (Questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento prima delle creature senza attacco improvviso.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Ogre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8525d27-b5f6-4c7d-b2a1-b0d6fba660b3\', \'multiverseId\': 263995}, \'multiverseid\': 263995}, {\'name\': \'血のオーガ\', \'text\': \'狂喜１ （このターン、いずれかの対戦相手にダメージが与えられている場合、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る）\\n先制攻撃 （このクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持たないクリーチャーよりも先に戦闘ダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de320526-aad0-43a0-a8ad-4a6545f9053d\', \'multiverseId\': 264244}, \'multiverseid\': 264244}, {\'name\': \'피의 오우거\', \'text\': \'피굶주림 1 (어느 한 상대라도 이 턴에 피해를 입었다면, 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.)선제공격 (이 생물은 선제공격이 없는 생물보다 먼저 전투피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 오우거 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f238b5f-c8ae-40db-b1ea-6a4985c38c5e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ogre de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Sede de sangue 1 (Se um oponente tiver sofrido dano neste turno, esta criatura entrará no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 sobre ela.)\\nIniciativa (Esta criatura causa dano de combate antes das criaturas sem iniciativa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ogre Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'754d557d-7775-455f-9061-7334d0ea4fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 264493}, \'multiverseid\': 264493}, {\'name\': \'Кровавый Огр\', \'text\': \'Кровожадность 1 (Если оппоненту в этом ходу были нанесены повреждения, это существо выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\\nПервый удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения раньше существ без Первого удара.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Огр Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9a0e324-5767-4810-b24b-474c16adee55\', \'multiverseId\': 264742}, \'multiverseid\': 264742}, {\'name\': \'血腥食人魔\', \'text\': \'嗜血1 （如果对手本回合曾受过伤害，此生物进场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n先攻 （此生物会比不具先攻异能的生物提前造成战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～食人魔／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c5ac9d4-602d-465b-b351-1099542cbb3f\', \'multiverseId\': 262999}, \'multiverseid\': 262999}, {\'name\': \'血腥食人魔\', \'text\': \'嗜血1 （如果對手本回合曾受過傷害，此生物進場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。）\\n先攻 （此生物會比不具先攻異能的生物提前造成戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～食人魔／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ea23ca-0132-4f5a-b84c-a82d80fd54eb\', \'multiverseId\': 263248}, \'multiverseid\': 263248}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutsucher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt, kannst du diesen Spieler 1 Lebenspunkt verlieren lassen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Ihm reicht ein Tropfen jetzt, um dich später zu finden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263705&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11591dfc-ea8d-4f4b-afaf-8169e51f3d47\', \'multiverseId\': 263705}, \'multiverseid\': 263705}, {\'name\': \'Buscador de sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente, puedes hacer que ese jugador pierda 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Una gota ahora es todo lo que necesita para encontrarte luego.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5f569ec-fe39-42c5-a36a-0eb88cb13129\', \'multiverseId\': 264950}, \'multiverseid\': 264950}, {\'name\': \'Chercheur de sang\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, vous pouvez faire que ce joueur perde 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Il lui suffit d\'une goutte maintenant pour vous retrouver plus tard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e4be9e-fd45-414f-8499-ceee53e8fa68\', \'multiverseId\': 263456}, \'multiverseid\': 263456}, {\'name\': \'Cercasangue\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario, puoi far perdere 1 punto vita a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Una goccia è tutto quel che gli serve ora per ritrovarti dopo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'707b4f76-47f3-440a-8455-8a865c2c1b9d\', \'multiverseId\': 263954}, \'multiverseid\': 263954}, {\'name\': \'血の求道者\', \'text\': \'いずれかの対戦相手のコントロール下でクリーチャーが１体戦場に出るたび、あなたは「そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'今の一滴は、後に彼がお前を見つけるのには十分。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1f6b909-afab-47b2-8e7f-ae7ba63cebf3\', \'multiverseId\': 264203}, \'multiverseid\': 264203}, {\'name\': \'구혈자\', \'text\': \'생물이 상대의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 그 상대로 하여금 생명 1점을 잃게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'단 한 방울이면 언제라도 널 찾을 수 있다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e214e43e-c259-4332-bad9-6f99bd9062c1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Caçador de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob o controle de um oponente, você pode fazer com que aquele jogador perca 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Uma gota agora é tudo de que ele precisa para lhe encontrar mais tarde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a263ba67-c3fa-42e1-b092-4f7d736e6dda\', \'multiverseId\': 264452}, \'multiverseid\': 264452}, {\'name\': \'Искатель Крови\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда существо выходит на поле битвы под контролем оппонента, вы можете заставить того игрока потерять 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Капля сейчас — это все, что ему нужно, чтобы найти вас потом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4520ac4a-3bb6-4b50-95e3-3c0c89ce47e7\', \'multiverseId\': 264701}, \'multiverseid\': 264701}, {\'name\': \'觅血师\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物在对手的操控下进战场时，你可以令该牌手失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'现在流的这一滴血，就足以让他稍后找到你。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e12bdae-e7f3-4481-8f3f-ceb4d6f8ef19\', \'multiverseId\': 262958}, \'multiverseid\': 262958}, {\'name\': \'覓血師\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物在對手的操控下進戰場時，你可以令該玩家失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'現在流的這一滴血，就足以讓他稍後找到你。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d33faeb8-8b33-4dd5-becd-0fe34eac552d\', \'multiverseId\': 263207}, \'multiverseid\': 263207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzorn-Vampir\', \'text\': \'Blutdurst 1 (Wurde einem Gegner in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt, kommt diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'Hinter den freundlichsten Gesichtern verstecken sich die schrecklichsten Gelüste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263707&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eedb469-9dbf-420a-8965-b155d420cf35\', \'multiverseId\': 263707}, \'multiverseid\': 263707}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro de la ira sangrienta\', \'text\': \'Sed de sangre 1. (Si un oponente recibió daño este turno, esta criatura entra en juego con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Las caras más amables esconden los deseos más abominables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91fab929-ecdc-4bb2-87b4-c832d0c8fb2c\', \'multiverseId\': 264952}, \'multiverseid\': 264952}, {\'name\': \'Vampire à la rage de sang\', \'text\': \'Soif de sang 1 (Si un adversaire a subi des blessures ce tour-ci, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': \'Les visages les plus doux cachent les désirs les plus abominables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ec9b569-52fa-4a96-a58d-552367e286cc\', \'multiverseId\': 263458}, \'multiverseid\': 263458}, {\'name\': "Vampiro dell\'Ira Sanguinaria", \'text\': \'Sete di sangue 1 (Se a un avversario è stato inflitto danno in questo turno, questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': "L\'apparenza più raffinata nasconde i desideri più abominevoli.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a35a975-213b-4090-bdde-eb9f879f1707\', \'multiverseId\': 263956}, \'multiverseid\': 263956}, {\'name\': \'血怒りの吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'狂喜１ （このターン、いずれかの対戦相手にダメージが与えられている場合、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'最も気取った上辺は、最も醜い欲望を隠す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f7fbc94-fb7a-4bbe-b41a-51ddbaf1ac55\', \'multiverseId\': 264205}, \'multiverseid\': 264205}, {\'name\': \'혈광 흡혈귀\', \'text\': \'피굶주림 1 (어느 한 상대라도 이 턴에 피해를 입었다면, 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'고상한 얼굴일수록 흉측한 욕망을 감추고 있기 마련이다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02909758-af9b-4dab-b189-0317fe678548\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro da Ira Sanguinária\', \'text\': \'Sede de sangue 1 (Se um oponente tiver sofrido dano neste turno, esta criatura entrará no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 sobre ela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'É atrás dos rostos mais gentis que se escondem os desejos mais abomináveis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'539078ac-cdaa-4d28-9424-c0b84aef1dc6\', \'multiverseId\': 264454}, \'multiverseid\': 264454}, {\'name\': \'Вампир Кровавой Ярости\', \'text\': \'Кровожадность 1 (Если оппоненту в этом ходу были нанесены повреждения, это существо выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'За самым утонченным фасадом скрываются самые чудовищные желания.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d01565-13da-466c-8bdd-6a57ecae589e\', \'multiverseId\': 264703}, \'multiverseid\': 264703}, {\'name\': \'血怒吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'嗜血1 （如果对手本回合曾受过伤害，此生物进场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'最守礼的外表掩藏着最可憎的欲望。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a23bda-f8f8-4f44-b2b0-8603a21da120\', \'multiverseId\': 262960}, \'multiverseid\': 262960}, {\'name\': \'血怒吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'嗜血1 （如果對手本回合曾受過傷害，此生物進場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'最守禮的外表掩藏著最可憎的慾望。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97fae53b-b822-4140-9291-ab730c9efdbc\', \'multiverseId\': 263209}, \'multiverseid\': 263209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra Hitzkopf\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra Hitzkopf fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n-2: Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Spontanzauber oder deine nächste Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauber. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\n-6: Chandra Hitzkopf fügt bis zu sechs Kreaturen und/oder Spielern deiner Wahl je 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263748&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a78cf85f-889e-4e65-bc1f-63eecec8f326\', \'multiverseId\': 263748}, \'multiverseid\': 263748}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, la instigadora\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, la instigadora hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\n-2: Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo instantáneo o conjuro este turno, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\n-6: Chandra, la instigadora hace 6 puntos de daño a cada una de hasta seis criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb4e040-da5a-484e-b56f-187d4ed454f6\', \'multiverseId\': 264993}, \'multiverseid\': 264993}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, le brandon\', \'text\': "+1 : Chandra, le brandon inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\n-2 : Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ce tour-ci, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\n-6 : Ciblez jusqu\'à six créatures et/ou joueurs. Chandra, le brandon leur inflige 6 blessures à chacune.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263499&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d861ed-fbd7-4dde-88cb-23af0515285b\', \'multiverseId\': 263499}, \'multiverseid\': 263499}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, il Tizzone Ardente\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, il Tizzone Ardente infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\n-2: Quando lanci la tua prossima magia istantaneo o stregoneria in questo turno, copiala. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\n-6: Scegli fino a sei creature e/o giocatori bersaglio. Chandra, il Tizzone Ardente infligge 6 danni a ciascuno di essi.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3781d9-63ac-4728-b550-b5611f4ce9b4\', \'multiverseId\': 263997}, \'multiverseid\': 263997}, {\'name\': \'炬火のチャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1: クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炬火のチャンドラはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n-2: このターン、あなたが次にインスタント呪文かソーサリー呪文を唱えたとき、その呪文をコピーする。 あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\n-6: クリーチャーやプレイヤーを最大６つまで対象とする。炬火のチャンドラはそれらにそれぞれ６点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68c71b5-9b72-46cc-a20c-d2b304daa468\', \'multiverseId\': 264246}, \'multiverseid\': 264246}, {\'name\': \'선동가 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물 한 개나 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 선동가 찬드라는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.-2: 이 턴에 당신이 다음으로 순간마법이나 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때, 그 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.-6: 생물 및 또는 플레이어를 대상으로 목표를 최고 여섯 개 까지 정한다. 선동가 찬드라는 각 목표에게 피해 6점씩을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d03584d5-2a8f-4fdb-b7f3-7975e6a0672e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, a Instigadora\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, a Instigadora, causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\\n-2: Quando você conjurar sua próxima mágica instantânea ou de feitiço neste turno, copie aquela mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\\n-6: Chandra, a Instigadora, causa 6 pontos de dano a cada um de até seis criaturas e/ou jogadores alvo.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f4e6b2-18d6-4591-a1bc-92458d673731\', \'multiverseId\': 264495}, \'multiverseid\': 264495}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Разжигательница\', \'text\': \'+1: Чандра, Разжигательница наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.\\n-2: когда вы будете разыгрывать ваше следующее мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства в этом ходу, скопируйте то заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для этой копии.\\n-6: Чандра, Разжигательница наносит 6 повреждений каждому из не более шести целевых существ и (или) игроков.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb54be5-3045-4709-aef8-4f3d9977e6e7\', \'multiverseId\': 264744}, \'multiverseid\': 264744}, {\'name\': \'惹事人茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：惹事人茜卓对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。\\n-2：当你于本回合施放下一个瞬间或法术咒语时，复制该咒语。 你可以为该复制选择新的目标。\\n-6：惹事人茜卓对至多六个目标生物和／或牌手各造成6点伤害。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6965907-67f7-45bc-a3b2-3cf1caba31cc\', \'multiverseId\': 263001}, \'multiverseid\': 263001}, {\'name\': \'惹事人茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：惹事人茜卓對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。\\n-2：當你於本回合施放下一個瞬間或巫術咒語時，複製該咒語。 你可以為該複製選擇新的目標。\\n-6：惹事人茜卓對至多六個目標生物和／或玩家各造成6點傷害。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5816dc4f-cffc-4540-92f2-7bf993d1ca7c\', \'multiverseId\': 263250}, \'multiverseid\': 263250}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Gewalttat\', \'text\': \'Chandras Gewalttat fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte und dem Beherrscher dieser Kreatur 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Chandra vertraute nie auf ihre „innere Stimme".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263749&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d9bb729-84c3-4082-a6f9-e6ebf49a8ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 263749}, \'multiverseid\': 263749}, {\'name\': \'Indignación de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Indignación de Chandra hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo y 2 puntos de daño al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Chandra nunca creyó en eso de usar su "voz interior".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2efc4c3f-2464-44da-b099-8d97271e87a6\', \'multiverseId\': 264994}, \'multiverseid\': 264994}, {\'name\': \'Dernier outrage de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Le Dernier outrage de Chandra inflige 4 blessures à la créature ciblée et 2 blessures au contrôleur de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Chandra n\'utilisait jamais sa « voix d\'intérieur ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263500&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9889d7ce-e1a7-4441-812b-323cd2529258\', \'multiverseId\': 263500}, \'multiverseid\': 263500}, {\'name\': \'Sdegno di Chandra\', \'text\': \'Lo Sdegno di Chandra infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio e 2 danni al controllore di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Chandra non ha mai creduto nel parlare "piano".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b137200e-c2cb-4ecc-ac57-ab102cb4bb78\', \'multiverseId\': 263998}, \'multiverseid\': 263998}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの憤慨\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。チャンドラの憤慨はそれに４点のダメージを与え、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'チャンドラは「おとなしい話し方」をしない主義だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64430f24-5546-4327-b6d0-e6bc20ec7999\', \'multiverseId\': 264247}, \'multiverseid\': 264247}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 격분\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 격분은 그 생물에게 피해 4점을 입히고 그 생물의 조종자에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'찬드라의 사전에는 "소근소근"이란 없다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ddff39-500d-4d6a-8ffb-bf2d95ee4720\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ultraje de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Ultraje de Chandra causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo e 2 pontos de dano ao controlador daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Chandra jamais acreditou que "falar baixinho" pudesse funcionar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee05b071-adeb-4053-bdfc-4e562de52f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 264496}, \'multiverseid\': 264496}, {\'name\': \'Буйство Чандры\', \'text\': \'Буйство Чандры наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу и 2 повреждения игроку, контролирующему то существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Чандра никогда не считала нужным слушать свой «внутренний голос».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'496b3eab-6d2e-4630-a8e3-41ad85aa32b0\', \'multiverseId\': 264745}, \'multiverseid\': 264745}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的暴怒\', \'text\': \'茜卓的暴怒对目标生物造成4点伤害，且对该生物的操控者造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'茜卓从不相信「内在的声音」这种事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c0416fa-16bf-475e-ad4d-1926c7e33d84\', \'multiverseId\': 263002}, \'multiverseid\': 263002}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的暴怒\', \'text\': \'茜卓的暴怒對目標生物造成4點傷害，且對該生物的操控者造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'茜卓從不相信「內在的聲音」這種事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd45340-576f-458a-b606-90827e5e31c8\', \'multiverseId\': 263251}, \'multiverseid\': 263251}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Phoenix\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nEile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\\nImmer wenn einem Gegner von einem roten Spontanzauber, einer roten Hexerei oder einem roten Planeswalker, den bzw. die du kontrollierst, Schaden zugefügt wird, bringe Chandras Phoenix aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263750&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e0768b7-a21d-46b3-88f9-e5e4e16da22d\', \'multiverseId\': 263750}, \'multiverseid\': 263750}, {\'name\': \'Fénix de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nPrisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entre bajo tu control.)\\nSiempre un oponente reciba daño de un hechizo instantáneo o conjuro rojo que controles o de un planeswalker rojo que controles, regresa el Fénix de Chandra de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3585b0-411a-4628-a347-22224ac730f2\', \'multiverseId\': 264995}, \'multiverseid\': 264995}, {\'name\': \'Phénix de Chandra\', \'text\': "Vol\\nCélérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire subit des blessures d\'un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel rouge que vous contrôlez ou d\'un planeswalker rouge que vous contrôlez, renvoyez dans votre main le Phénix de Chandra depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d93b6108-8f44-4321-9ceb-bc03c89a87db\', \'multiverseId\': 263501}, \'multiverseid\': 263501}, {\'name\': \'Fenice di Chandra\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nRapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\\nOgniqualvolta a un avversario viene inflitto danno da una magia istantaneo o stregoneria rossa che controlli o da un planeswalker rosso che controlli, riprendi in mano la Fenice di Chandra dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Fenice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cf89dba-4d3f-4d74-bec1-a7ff02a85b48\', \'multiverseId\': 263999}, \'multiverseid\': 263999}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラのフェニックス\', \'text\': \'飛行速攻\\n （このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）\\nあなたがコントロールする、赤のインスタント呪文１つか赤のソーサリー呪文１つか赤のプレインズウォーカー１人が、いずれかの対戦相手にダメージを与えるたび、チャンドラのフェニックスをあなたの墓地からあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d92e248-cf10-4625-8c52-4ed7287477f7\', \'multiverseId\': 264248}, \'multiverseid\': 264248}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 불사조\', \'text\': \'비행신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격할 수도 있고 할 수도 있다.)당신이 조종하는 적색 순간마법 주문이나 적색 집중마법 주문이나 적색 플레인즈워커가 상대에게 피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신의 무덤에서 찬드라의 불사조를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 불사조\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668da899-0a1c-4fec-8521-ea11d4fab7b1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Fênix de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nÍmpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que entra sob seu controle.)\\nToda vez que um oponente sofrer dano de uma mágica instantânea ou de feitiço vermelha que você controla ou de um planeswalker vermelho que você controla, devolva Fênix de Chandra de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fênix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2594cc4-f511-4f51-a5a8-14eafcacf3f4\', \'multiverseId\': 264497}, \'multiverseid\': 264497}, {\'name\': \'Феникс Чандры\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nУскорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)\\nКаждый раз когда красное мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства под вашим контролем, или красный planeswalker под вашим контролем наносит повреждения оппоненту, верните Феникса Чандры из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Феникс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb248016-f6d2-41dc-8d9e-5ef0162e345d\', \'multiverseId\': 264746}, \'multiverseid\': 264746}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的凤凰\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n敏捷 （此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\\n每当由你操控的红色瞬间或法术咒语、或由你操控的红色鹏洛客向对手造成伤害时，将茜卓的凤凰从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～凤凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f64929f3-f4b7-4aa8-af7d-aa56c82e9fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 263003}, \'multiverseid\': 263003}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的鳳凰\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n敏捷 （此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）\\n每當由你操控的紅色瞬間或巫術咒語、或由你操控的紅色鵬洛客向對手造成傷害時，將茜卓的鳳凰從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳳凰\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a68f8d3-b4a7-4175-8504-190de8f0cdc3\', \'multiverseId\': 263252}, \'multiverseid\': 263252}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Auge des Kraken\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen blauen Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es hat die Wunder vieler Welten gesehen, obwohl es in den Tiefen eines bodenlosen Meeres gefangen war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263835&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa4e1061-e0af-4d29-9454-cdce71575d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 263835}, \'multiverseid\': 263835}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de kraken\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo azul, puedes ganar 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Ha visto las maravillas de mundos enteros atrapadas en las profundidades de un océano sin fondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92788909-cdbd-429b-8d83-9dd2e18101df\', \'multiverseId\': 265080}, \'multiverseid\': 265080}, {\'name\': \'Œil du kraken\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort bleu, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il a vu les merveilles de mondes entiers piégés dans les profondeurs d\'un océan sans fond.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263586&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3488a50f-86a1-4250-9e09-c732480fe66a\', \'multiverseId\': 263586}, \'multiverseid\': 263586}, {\'name\': \'Occhio del Kraken\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia blu, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Ha visto le meraviglie di mondi interi intrappolati nelle profondità di un oceano insondabile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730c9969-5ed7-4da9-b617-80d87079daeb\', \'multiverseId\': 264084}, \'multiverseid\': 264084}, {\'name\': \'クラーケンの目\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが青の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それは底無しの深海に捕らえられた世界中の不思議を見てきた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4489bfa1-e810-4934-8aea-fb6f1e27d8fa\', \'multiverseId\': 264333}, \'multiverseid\': 264333}, {\'name\': \'크라켄의 눈알\', \'text\': \'어느 플레이어가 청색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 생멸 1점을 얻을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'저것은 밑 모를 심연에 있으면서 여러 세계의 불가사의를 봐 왔다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f03e5a22-b0b0-4003-a62b-cefc2a12b773\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Olho de Kraken\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjura uma mágica azul, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ele viu maravilhas de mundos inteiros aprisionadas nas profundezas de um oceano sem fim.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f209cd80-c3ab-42ea-aedf-e6c2c470c1f7\', \'multiverseId\': 264582}, \'multiverseid\': 264582}, {\'name\': \'Глаз Кракена\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда игрок разыгрывает синее заклинание, вы можете получить 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Он видел целые миры, захваченные глубинами бездонного океана.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0eea2fb-f967-4861-8d0a-e2ec06e43b92\', \'multiverseId\': 264831}, \'multiverseid\': 264831}, {\'name\': \'巨怪硕眼\', \'text\': \'每当牌手施放任何蓝色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它见过整个世界陷入无底汪洋深渊的神奇景象。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fc4c3fa-0a19-4556-996a-ca7f1c3934c0\', \'multiverseId\': 263088}, \'multiverseid\': 263088}, {\'name\': \'巨怪碩眼\', \'text\': \'每當玩家施放任何藍色咒語時，你可以獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它見過整個世界陷入無底汪洋深淵的神奇景象。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3649152a-cad1-48a5-b225-c930167b8d5e\', \'multiverseId\': 263337}, \'multiverseid\': 263337}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenklaue\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen roten Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu erhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn es ein Feuer gibt, das nie zu brennen aufhört, dann kommt es sicher aus dem Maul eines Drachen." —Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263830&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ed63ea3-60f1-42f4-a875-9ee20b6010b8\', \'multiverseId\': 263830}, \'multiverseid\': 263830}, {\'name\': \'Garra de dragón\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo rojo, puedes ganar 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Si existe un fuego que nunca deje de arder, estará seguramente en las fauces de un dragón." —Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2728e6df-1faa-42f4-8e48-b2e92b33960a\', \'multiverseId\': 265075}, \'multiverseid\': 265075}, {\'name\': \'Griffe du dragon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort rouge, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« S\'il y a bien une flamme éternelle, c\'est celle qui brûle dans la gueule d\'un dragon. » —Sarkhan Vol", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8509df1a-c298-4dc5-96d4-9b9073cfc209\', \'multiverseId\': 263581}, \'multiverseid\': 263581}, {\'name\': \'Artiglio di Drago\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia rossa, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Se esiste un fuoco che non smette mai di bruciare, di sicuro è nelle fauci di un drago." —Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ddd04e-195e-46cd-8392-75c8a1e27874\', \'multiverseId\': 264079}, \'multiverseid\': 264079}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの爪\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが赤の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「決して消えぬ火というものがあるのなら、それは間違いなくドラゴンの口の中にあるのだろうな。」 ――サルカン・ヴォル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d3c888-a133-4094-a31e-f0c9e92aaf66\', \'multiverseId\': 264328}, \'multiverseid\': 264328}, {\'name\': \'용의 발톱\', \'text\': \'어느 플레이어가 적색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"만약에 영원히 꺼지지 않는 불이 있다면, 그건 용의 아가리에 있음이 분명해."—사르칸 볼\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ab750a3-9c9b-468f-ae89-eb917918a4db\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Garra de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjura uma mágica vermelha, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Se há um fogo que nunca deixa de arder, este encontra-se certamente na boca de um dragão." — Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c9b6f3-4d71-426f-b2d4-18fde8a6c662\', \'multiverseId\': 264577}, \'multiverseid\': 264577}, {\'name\': \'Коготь Дракона\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда игрок разыгрывает красное заклинание, вы можете получить 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Если есть пламя, которое никогда не гаснет, то это огонь в пасти дракона». — Сархан Воль\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'764eeff7-c91c-4e3e-bafd-036dae2aa167\', \'multiverseId\': 264826}, \'multiverseid\': 264826}, {\'name\': \'巨龙钩爪\', \'text\': \'每当牌手施放任何红色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如果有永不熄灭的火焰，就一定是在巨龙喉头。」 ～萨坎沃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e50c7ba-2bc9-40b9-88e8-86fd60651fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 263083}, \'multiverseid\': 263083}, {\'name\': \'巨龍鈎爪\', \'text\': \'每當玩家施放任何紅色咒語時，你可以獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如果有永不熄滅的火焰，就一定是在巨龍喉頭。」 ～薩坎沃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16ec1e76-6a2e-4dcb-a13d-2ac8b39e87c0\', \'multiverseId\': 263332}, \'multiverseid\': 263332}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenschädel-Pass', 'text': 'Der Drachenschädel-Pass kommt getappt ins Spiel, falls du nicht einen Sumpf oder ein Gebirge kontrollierst.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263849&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07ea3be7-6760-42c9-bbef-2e753152c30c', 'multiverseId': 263849}, 'multiverseid': 263849}, {'name': 'Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón', 'text': 'La Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles un pantano o una montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265094&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f45f385-b081-42bc-87fd-826ec1da7811', 'multiverseId': 265094}, 'multiverseid': 265094}, {'name': 'Sommet du Crânedragon', 'text': 'Le Sommet du Crânedragon arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez un marais ou une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263600&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ab2edef-844c-4e6c-a4ab-ceee077eaa3a', 'multiverseId': 263600}, 'multiverseid': 263600}, {'name': 'Vetta del Teschio di Drago', 'text': 'La Vetta del Teschio di Drago entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una Palude o una Montagna.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264098&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1f899c6-f7f0-4a45-aa74-6438205b973c', 'multiverseId': 264098}, 'multiverseid': 264098}, {'name': '竜髑髏の山頂', 'text': '竜髑髏の山頂は、あなたが沼か山をコントロールしていないかぎり、タップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264347&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd195394b-24d8-4849-8069-ffa791ef2c58', 'multiverseId': 264347}, 'multiverseid': 264347}, {'name': '용두개골 봉우리', 'text': '용두개골 봉우리는 당신이 늪이나 산을 조종하지 않으면 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.: 나 를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e30a3f43-f8dc-4aff-abe8-e9bc87c6761f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pico da Caveira de Dragão', 'text': 'Pico da Caveira de Dragão entra no campo de batalha virado a menos que você controle um Pântano ou uma Montanha.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264596&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3ca129b-5c92-4e09-9b55-ee93ebc58cb2', 'multiverseId': 264596}, 'multiverseid': 264596}, {'name': 'Пик Драконьего Черепа', 'text': 'Пик Драконьего Черепа выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет Болота или Горы.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {R} в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264845&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '586f0ef0-3e68-4e1c-8709-e58234d7b3c0', 'multiverseId': 264845}, 'multiverseid': 264845}, {'name': '龙颅山峰', 'text': '除非你操控沼泽或山脉，否则龙颅山峰须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263102&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7d72ca7-c2c7-462b-bf2f-e87397d6b643', 'multiverseId': 263102}, 'multiverseid': 263102}, {'name': '龍顱山峰', 'text': '除非你操控沼澤或山脈，否則龍顱山峰須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的魔法力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263351&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9477cc55-2269-41b0-afa1-5580a2028722', 'multiverseId': 263351}, 'multiverseid': 263351}]", '[{\'name\': \'Druidentasche\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, bringe einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Falls es ein Land ist, bringe es unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Falls die Karte weder ein Land noch eine Kreatur ist, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263831&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4de1eb5-9d7e-44ca-9077-aa5a6335b10e\', \'multiverseId\': 263831}, \'multiverseid\': 263831}, {\'name\': \'Saco druídico\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1. Si es una carta de tierra, ponla en el campo de batalla bajo tu control. Si es una carta que no sea tierra ni criatura, gana 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d8ca2b5-5177-4e71-913d-7d68c377b743\', \'multiverseId\': 265076}, \'multiverseid\': 265076}, {\'name\': \'Sacoche druidique\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte. Si c\'est une carte de terrain, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. Si c\'est une carte non-créature, non-terrain, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771d5b00-07a4-4e2d-a5c9-7b8300f7aa33\', \'multiverseId\': 263582}, \'multiverseid\': 263582}, {\'name\': \'Borsa del Druido\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde. Se è una carta terra, mettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. Se è una carta non creatura, non terra, guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a167989-13aa-404f-8628-0e86a80fb652\', \'multiverseId\': 264080}, \'multiverseid\': 264080}, {\'name\': \'ドルイドの物入れ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。 それがクリーチャー・カードである場合、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。 それが土地カードである場合、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。 それがクリーチャーでも土地でもないカードである場合、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc20b064-9e1b-46ea-8ea5-3b3ff2e45787\', \'multiverseId\': 264329}, \'multiverseid\': 264329}, {\'name\': \'드루이드풍 책가방\', \'text\': \', : 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 공개한다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면, 1/1 녹색 부생수 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 카드가 대지 카드라면, 그 카드를 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓는다. 그 카드가 생물도 대지도 아닌 카드라면, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e119536-ee8d-4a3f-afde-58180fd5a021\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa Druídica\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Saprófita. Se for um card de terreno, coloque-o no campo de batalha sob o seu controle. Se não for um card de criatura nem de terreno, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e0bf0c4-e6d5-49c5-a8ea-276f02d0864d\', \'multiverseId\': 264578}, \'multiverseid\': 264578}, {\'name\': \'Сумка Друида\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта существа, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Сапролинг. Если это карта земли, положите ту карту на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Если это карта, не являющаяся ни существом, ни землей, вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9b78ed-176d-41fb-8999-a6f650ba1950\', \'multiverseId\': 264827}, \'multiverseid\': 264827}, {\'name\': \'德鲁伊背包\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：展示你的牌库顶牌。 如果它是生物牌，则将一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物放进战场。 如果它是地牌，则将该牌在你的操控下放进战场。 如果它是非生物且非地的牌，则你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77f4d099-a8be-4e4b-ae40-d7890da8c7af\', \'multiverseId\': 263084}, \'multiverseid\': 263084}, {\'name\': \'德魯伊背包\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：展示你的牌庫頂牌。 如果它是生物牌，則將一個1/1綠色腐生物衍生生物放進戰場。 如果它是地牌，則將該牌在你的操控下放進戰場。 如果它是非生物且非地的牌，則你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cb3896a-2c7c-4acd-ae8c-95dbaf8b5c52\', \'multiverseId\': 263333}, \'multiverseid\': 263333}]', "[{'name': 'Dschinn der Wünsche', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nDer Dschinn der Wünsche kommt mit drei Wunschmarken ins Spiel.\\n{2}{U}{U}, entferne eine Wunschmarke vom Dschinn der Wünsche: Zeige die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek offen vor. Du kannst diese Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls du es nicht tust, schicke sie ins Exil.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dschinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263675&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '829ef6e0-d2b7-445a-8127-0a6587c93f93', 'multiverseId': 263675}, 'multiverseid': 263675}, {'name': 'Djinn de los deseos', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nEl Djinn de los deseos entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores de deseo sobre él.\\n{2}{U}{U}, remover un contador de deseo del Djinn de los deseos: Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Si no lo haces, exíliala.', 'type': 'Criatura — Djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264920&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbe76c3f-f02a-4202-8666-eba810484e99', 'multiverseId': 264920}, 'multiverseid': 264920}, {'name': 'Djinn aux souhaits', 'text': 'Vol\\nLe Djinn aux souhaits arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs « souhait ».\\n{2}{U}{U}, retirez un marqueur « souhait » au Djinn aux souhaits : Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Si vous ne le faites pas, exilez-la.', 'type': 'Créature : djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263426&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa802672-6e73-4e98-9df8-429841f5615f', 'multiverseId': 263426}, 'multiverseid': 263426}, {'name': 'Genio dei Desideri', 'text': 'Volare\\nIl Genio dei Desideri entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini desiderio.\\n{2}{U}{U}, Rimuovi un segnalino desiderio dal Genio dei Desideri: Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se non lo fai, esiliala.', 'type': 'Creatura — Genio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263924&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d48b37b-371a-4272-b89a-02eed3650424', 'multiverseId': 263924}, 'multiverseid': 263924}, {'name': '願いのジン', 'text': '飛行\\n願いのジンは、願いカウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{U}{U}, 願いのジンから願いカウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。 あなたはそのカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。 そうしない場合、それを追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264173&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '406e210d-70e8-4372-bc32-18438220b57d', 'multiverseId': 264173}, 'multiverseid': 264173}, {'name': '소원의 지니', 'text': '비행소원의 지니는 소원 카운터 세 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다., 소원의 지니에서 소원 카운터 한 개를 제거한다: 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 공개한다. 당신은 마나비용을 지불하지 않으면서 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 그렇게 하지 않는다면, 그 카드를 추방한다.', 'type': '생물 — 지니', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73295a4c-7173-4ba9-843e-fb592b0e360a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Gênio dos Desejos', 'text': 'Voar\\nGênio dos Desejos entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores de desejo sobre ele.\\n{2}{U}{U}, Remova um marcador de desejo de Gênio dos Desejos: Revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se não fizer isso, exile-o.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gênio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264422&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8e1d77c-f50c-4bfe-aaff-9bffb18bc99b', 'multiverseId': 264422}, 'multiverseid': 264422}, {'name': 'Джинн Желаний', 'text': 'Полет\\nДжинн Желаний выходит на поле битвы с тремя жетонами желания на нем.\\n{2}{U}{U}, удалите жетон желания с Джинна Желаний: покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты её мана-стоимости. Если вы этого не делаете, изгоните ее.', 'type': 'Существо — Джинн', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264671&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab193d59-b0ad-4068-a941-da5cd97f0b56', 'multiverseId': 264671}, 'multiverseid': 264671}, {'name': '祈愿巨灵', 'text': '飞行\\n祈愿巨灵进战场时上面有三个祈愿指示物。\\n{2}{U}{U}，从祈愿巨灵上移去一个祈愿指示物：展示你的牌库顶牌。 你可以使用该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果你不使用，则将它放逐。', 'type': '生物～巨灵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262928&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b71309c1-2903-4838-be1e-fb57aa5dd8d6', 'multiverseId': 262928}, 'multiverseid': 262928}, {'name': '祈願巨靈', 'text': '飛行\\n祈願巨靈進戰場時上面有三個祈願指示物。\\n{2}{U}{U}，從祈願巨靈上移去一個祈願指示物：展示你的牌庫頂牌。 你可以使用該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。如果你不使用，則將它放逐。', 'type': '生物～巨靈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263177&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cff6c064-ad18-42ed-acbc-a2488e66d45b', 'multiverseId': 263177}, 'multiverseid': 263177}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dunkle Gunst\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nWenn die Dunkle Gunst ins Spiel kommt, verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Als er begann, das zu verfluchen, was ihm zuvor heilig war, wuchs seine Stärke unermesslich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e737c851-b786-4336-b679-d5b0d33beadd\', \'multiverseId\': 263713}, \'multiverseid\': 263713}, {\'name\': \'Favor oscuro\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Favor oscuro entre al campo de batalla, pierdes 1 vida.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando comenzó a maldecir lo que consideraba sagrado, su fuerza creció de forma incomparable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cba049e7-8c0e-4c8c-9d95-d63d958a83df\', \'multiverseId\': 264958}, \'multiverseid\': 264958}, {\'name\': \'Obscure faveur\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand l\'Obscure faveur arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous perdez 1 point de vie.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+1.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Quand il commença à maudire ce qu\'il considérait comme sacré, sa force devint sans pareille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f6d3c3-9244-4f44-8747-10164cea0ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 263464}, \'multiverseid\': 263464}, {\'name\': \'Benevolenza Oscura\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Benevolenza Oscura entra nel campo di battaglia, perdi 1 punto vita.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Quando iniziò a maledire ciò che considerava santo, la sua forza divenne senza pari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1100566-5d99-4f81-aa21-62d567cb8f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 263962}, \'multiverseid\': 263962}, {\'name\': \'闇の好意\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n闇の好意が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを失う。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'神聖だと思っていたものを冒涜し始めたとき、その力は類無きものになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b86b1737-7ff4-460d-b763-876ef08638b9\', \'multiverseId\': 264211}, \'multiverseid\': 264211}, {\'name\': \'악의 은혜\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여악의 은혜가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 1점을 잃는다.부여된 생물은 +3/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'성스럽게 여기던 것을 저주하기 시작하자, 그는 누구보다도 강해졌다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2324fc2-bcfa-4a6c-a7aa-db096d0b060e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Proteção Sombria\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Proteção Sombria entra no campo de batalha, você perde 1 ponto de vida.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ele começou a blasfemar o que considerava sagrado, sua força aumentou de modo inigualável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f29f103-3d06-45b3-8130-f17b2e18631f\', \'multiverseId\': 264460}, \'multiverseid\': 264460}, {\'name\': \'Темное Покровительство\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда Темное Покровительство выходит на поле битвы, вы теряете 1 жизнь.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Когда он начал проклинать то, что почитал как святыню, его сила стала неимоверно расти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c3d291-9ea1-4d5f-8882-7924da30a0af\', \'multiverseId\': 264709}, \'multiverseid\': 264709}, {\'name\': \'黑暗眷顾\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当黑暗眷顾进战场时，你失去1点生命。\\n所结附的生物得+3/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'当他开始诅咒自己曾珍视的东西，其力量就变得无人匹敌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c7ff1c-03b0-4dec-be30-89373c4f42f7\', \'multiverseId\': 262966}, \'multiverseid\': 262966}, {\'name\': \'黑暗眷顧\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n當黑暗眷顧進戰場時，你失去1點生命。\\n所結附的生物得+3/+1。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'當他開始詛咒自己曾珍視的東西，其力量就變得無人匹敵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86580dc7-92f7-4026-aad8-0990e72a5622\', \'multiverseId\': 263215}, \'multiverseid\': 263215}]', "[{'name': 'Dämmerjagd-Fledermaus', 'text': 'Blutdurst 1 (Wurde einem Gegner in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt, kommt diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.)\\nFliegend', 'type': 'Kreatur — Fledermaus', 'flavor': 'Die Sümpfe werden still, wenn sie herangleitet, doch sie kann dennoch den Herzschlag ihrer Opfer vernehmen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263721&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3208d6cc-c06e-43f5-b041-2342a9c77bae', 'multiverseId': 263721}, 'multiverseid': 263721}, {'name': 'Murciélago cazador crepuscular', 'text': 'Sed de sangre 1. (Si un oponente recibió daño este turno, esta criatura entra en juego con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nVuela.', 'type': 'Criatura — Murciélago', 'flavor': 'Aunque los pantanos se silencian cuando se acerca, sigue escuchando los latidos de su presa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264966&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6874dbe-5114-450e-bb35-5ee515d9175d', 'multiverseId': 264966}, 'multiverseid': 264966}, {'name': 'Chauve-souris du crépuscule', 'text': 'Soif de sang 1 (Si un adversaire a subi des blessures ce tour-ci, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1.)\\nVol', 'type': 'Créature : chauve-souris', 'flavor': 'Le silence tombe sur les marais à son approche, mais les battements de cœur de sa proie ne lui échappent pas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263472&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '688f4760-c4a1-491d-854c-37d226968147', 'multiverseId': 263472}, 'multiverseid': 263472}, {'name': 'Pipistrello del Crepuscolo', 'text': 'Sete di sangue 1 (Se a un avversario è stato inflitto danno in questo turno, questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.)\\nVolare', 'type': 'Creatura — Pipistrello', 'flavor': 'Le paludi si zittiscono quando si avvicina, ma sente comunque il battito del cuore delle prede che vi si nascondono.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263970&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c70555d-6c3a-484c-afd1-694382b24dc3', 'multiverseId': 263970}, 'multiverseid': 263970}, {'name': '薄暮狩りのコウモリ', 'text': '狂喜１ （このターン、いずれかの対戦相手にダメージが与えられている場合、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る）飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — コウモリ', 'flavor': 'それが近づくにつれ沼は静まるが、それでもその中の獲物の鼓動は聞こえる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264219&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fcc83eb-d63f-4bf9-be51-0737bf5573c9', 'multiverseId': 264219}, 'multiverseid': 264219}, {'name': '황혼사냥꾼 박쥐', 'text': '피굶주림 1 (어느 한 상대라도 이 턴에 피해를 입었다면, 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.)비행', 'type': '생물 — 박쥐', 'flavor': '그것이 등장하면 늪지대는 조용해지지만, 그렇다고 먹잇감의 심장 박동이 안 들리는 건 아니다.', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '651b9d73-9c38-44bd-b999-af985e889bd3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Morcego Caçador do Crepúsculo', 'text': 'Sede de sangue 1 (Se um oponente tiver sofrido dano neste turno, esta criatura entrará no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 sobre ela.)\\nVoar', 'type': 'Criatura — Morcego', 'flavor': 'Os pântanos silenciam-se quando ele se aproxima, mas ele ainda consegue ouvir o coração de sua presa batendo lá dentro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264468&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b83f2e62-ff8a-4a05-b930-7b1fa83a877c', 'multiverseId': 264468}, 'multiverseid': 264468}, {'name': 'Нетопырь, Сумеречный Охотник', 'text': 'Кровожадность 1 (Если оппоненту в этом ходу были нанесены повреждения, это существо выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\\nПолет', 'type': 'Существо — Летучая-мышь', 'flavor': 'Болота замирают при его приближении, но он все равно слышит сердцебиение скрывающейся в них добычи.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264717&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29979265-87d9-4e38-9dae-a6230500fac0', 'multiverseId': 264717}, 'multiverseid': 264717}, {'name': '暮猎蝙蝠', 'text': '嗜血1 （如果对手本回合曾受过伤害，此生物进场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n飞行', 'type': '生物～蝙蝠', 'flavor': '沼泽因其现身而陷入寂静，但他依旧能听到猎物的心跳声。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=262974&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '368e329a-e322-4235-9326-3d0eec34da27', 'multiverseId': 262974}, 'multiverseid': 262974}, {'name': '暮獵蝙蝠', 'text': '嗜血1 （如果對手本回合曾受過傷害，此生物進場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。）\\n飛行', 'type': '生物～蝙蝠', 'flavor': '沼澤因其現身而陷入寂靜，但牠依舊能聽到獵物的心跳聲。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263223&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e667a2b-b8a8-4566-9269-82cdb0a01f65', 'multiverseId': 263223}, 'multiverseid': 263223}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dämonenhorn\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen schwarzen Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Biegungen verspotten die Kurven von Leben und Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263829&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba3240b1-ddda-4471-85c0-f55d1aee0b55\', \'multiverseId\': 263829}, \'multiverseid\': 263829}, {\'name\': \'Cuerno de demonio\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo negro, puedes ganar 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Su curvatura simboliza las vueltas de la vida y la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=265074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4e3a8a-4711-4829-9267-414c202323e7\', \'multiverseId\': 265074}, \'multiverseid\': 265074}, {\'name\': \'Corne de démon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort noir, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Ses courbes imitent les méandres de la vie et de la mort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=263580&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362f059d-1686-4df3-b8e2-f99e61bc7cba\', \'multiverseId\': 263580}, \'multiverseid\': 263580}, {\'name\': \'Corno del Demone\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia nera, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La sua foggia imita gli intrecci di vita e morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c82d710-dbee-432d-968c-2cd8e7a5fe03\', \'multiverseId\': 264078}, \'multiverseid\': 264078}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の角\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが黒の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その曲がり様は、生と死の絡み合いを模している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473d8186-f525-4e53-92b8-b5a1099aff5c\', \'multiverseId\': 264327}, \'multiverseid\': 264327}, {\'name\': \'악마의 뿔\', \'text\': \'어느 플레이어가 흑색 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'저것의 곡선은 생과 사의 우여곡절을 시늉한다.\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a18fd5c-f545-404d-a837-7af05b9af620\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Chifre de Demônio\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjura uma mágica preta, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Sua curvatura imita as viravoltas da vida e da morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b7c117-54d8-47ef-9922-6b3656a068bd\', \'multiverseId\': 264576}, \'multiverseid\': 264576}, {\'name\': \'Рог Демона\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда игрок разыгрывает черное заклинание, вы можете получить 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Его изгиб повторяет сплетение жизни и смерти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=264825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c03553-4de1-4922-9b4d-039e786c7237\', \'multiverseId\': 264825}, \'multiverseid\': 264825}, {\'name\': \'恶魔犄角\', \'text\': \'每当牌手施放任何黑色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'其弯弧好似生与死的纠结。\', \'ima